    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Pantry": "Take what you need, leave what you can! The inside is refrigerated, too, nice.",
    //MAIL
    "MV.Municipal.Mail.1": "Pelican Town Residents,^   Thanks to funds from the Keep the Valley Safe tax that you voted for, the Pelican Town Municipal building is almost complete!^   Once Robin's done putting the finishing touches to the interior and once he's confirmed, our new sheriff will be able to move right in. We have a legal clerk commuting in from Zuzu who will man the desk and the phones.^   We've also been granted a license from Ferngill Post to start offering basic postal services. I'm sure that we are all excited that we will no longer have to go out of town to file simple legal paperwork, renew a driver's license, or get our mail sorted.   ^   -Mayor Lewis",
    "MV.Municipal.Mail.Title.1": "Pelican Town Municipal Nearly Open",
    "MV.Municipal.Mail.2.true": "Pelican Town Residents,^   The Pelican Town Municipal building is now open! Ayeisha is sure pleased to have a place to set things down while she's in town. Come on down and meet the Sheriff William Stewart, though he'd rather you call him Bill! He hopes that he can be worthy of your trust in his protection.^   At the desk is legal clerk Alicia Moore from Zuzu. Come to her if you need any help with legal papers or packages. We can thank her for the supply of fire extinguishers she's arranged as well! One is enclosed, and a replacement or a storage cabinet can be purchased at her desk.  ^   -Mayor Lewis",
    "MV.Municipal.Mail.2.false": "Pelican Town Residents,^   The Pelican Town Municipal building is now open! Our mail carrier is sure pleased to have a place to set things down while they're in town. Come on down and meet the Sheriff William Stewart, though he'd rather you call him Bill! He hopes that he can be worthy of your trust in his protection.^   At the desk is legal clerk Alicia Moore from Zuzu. Come to her if you need any help with legal papers or packages. We can thank her for the supply of fire extinguishers she's arranged as well! One is enclosed, and a replacement or a storage cabinet can be purchased at her desk.  ^   -Mayor Lewis",
    "MV.Municipal.Mail.Title.2": "Pelican Town Municipal Opening",
    "MV.Municipal.Mail.3": "Pelican Town Residents,^   Everybody is welcome to come out to the front of the old community center at 1:00 today for a community meeting. I hope to discuss future steps in keeping y'all safe and to address your concerns and suggestions.  ^   -Sheriff Bill",
    "MV.Municipal.Mail.Title.3": "Pelican Town Community Meeting",
    "MV.Municipal.Mail.4.true.true": "Pelican Town Residents,^   Thanks to y'all, we've got several community services available starting today. If you've got any more ideas, you know where to send them.^First, you can now donate money to a selection of local causes through the mail slot by the mail room door in the Municipal Building. A good suggestion from Ayeisha, since it stays locked up for safety anyhow.^Then we've got Robin and Maru's work, the Little Free Pantry. It's down by the Little Free Library, near the mayor's house. Robin's made the weatherproof shell and Maru set up refrigeration, so you can donate perishables.^Next, we've got Haley's suggestion, a place to donate clothing to those in need. Blankets are also welcome! This is located in the Municipal Building in the back. It's big and blue and on the right, can't miss it.^Beside the clothing donation box is a bunch of pamphlets and resources for financial and health services, therapy, that sort of thing. Thanks to Harvey for getting it all together and Pam for offering her time to make sure people can get to their appointments out of town.^Even the kids have all volunteered for trash patrol in between community cleanup days. Y'all can be proud of the work you've done to support your local community. I know I'm proud of all of you and proud to call Pelican Town home.   ^   -Sheriff Bill",
    "MV.Municipal.Mail.4.false.true": "Pelican Town Residents,^   Thanks to y'all, we've got several community services available starting today. If you've got any more ideas, you know where to send them.^First, you can now donate money to a selection of local causes through the mail slot by the mail room door in the Municipal Building. A good suggestion from Ayeisha, since it stays locked up for safety anyhow.^Then we've got Robin and Maru's work, the Little Free Pantry. It's down by the mayor's house, on the side towards the library. Robin's made the weatherproof shell and Maru set up refrigeration, so you can donate perishables.^Next, we've got Haley's suggestion, a place to donate clothing to those in need. Blankets are also welcome! This is located in the Municipal Building in the back. It's big and blue and on the right, can't miss it.^Beside the clothing donation box is a bunch of pamphlets and resources for financial and health services, therapy, that sort of thing. Thanks to Harvey for getting it all together and Pam for offering her time to make sure people can get to their appointments out of town.^Even the kids have all volunteered for trash patrol in between community cleanup days. Y'all can be proud of the work you've done to support your local community. I know I'm proud of all of you and proud to call Pelican Town home.   ^   -Sheriff Bill",
    "MV.Municipal.Mail.4.true.false": "Pelican Town Residents,^   Thanks to y'all, we've got several community services available starting today. If you've got any more ideas, you know where to send them.^First, you can now donate money to a selection of local causes through the mail slot by the mail room door in the Municipal Building. A good suggestion from our mail carrier, since it stays locked up for safety anyhow.^Then we've got Robin and Maru's work, the Little Free Pantry. It's down by the Little Free Library, near the mayor's house. Robin's made the weatherproof shell and Maru set up refrigeration, so you can donate perishables.^Next, we've got Haley's suggestion, a place to donate clothing to those in need. Blankets are also welcome! This is located in the Municipal Building in the back. It's big and blue and on the right, can't miss it.^Beside the clothing donation box is a bunch of pamphlets and resources for financial and health services, therapy, that sort of thing. Thanks to Harvey for getting it all together and Pam for offering her time to make sure people can get to their appointments out of town.^Even the kids have all volunteered for trash patrol in between community cleanup days. Y'all can be proud of the work you've done to support your local community. I know I'm proud of all of you and proud to call Pelican Town home.   ^   -Sheriff Bill",
    "MV.Municipal.Mail.4.false.false": "Pelican Town Residents,^   Thanks to y'all, we've got several community services available starting today. If you've got any more ideas, you know where to send them.^First, you can now donate money to a selection of local causes through the mail slot by the mail room door in the Municipal Building. A good suggestion from our mail carrier, since it stays locked up for safety anyhow.^Then we've got Robin and Maru's work, the Little Free Pantry. It's down by the mayor's house, on the side towards the library. Robin's made the weatherproof shell and Maru set up refrigeration, so you can donate perishables.^Next, we've got Haley's suggestion, a place to donate clothing to those in need. Blankets are also welcome! This is located in the Municipal Building in the back. It's big and blue and on the right, can't miss it.^Beside the clothing donation box is a bunch of pamphlets and resources for financial and health services, therapy, that sort of thing. Thanks to Harvey for getting it all together and Pam for offering her time to make sure people can get to their appointments out of town.^Even the kids have all volunteered for trash patrol in between community cleanup days. Y'all can be proud of the work you've done to support your local community. I know I'm proud of all of you and proud to call Pelican Town home.   ^   -Sheriff Bill",
    "MV.Municipal.Mail.Title.4": "Pelican Town Community Services",
    "MV.Municipal.Mail.5": "Howdy,^Figured you could use this old recipe my grandma passed onto me. It's one of my favorites.   ^   -Sheriff Bill",
    "MV.Municipal.Mail.Title.5": "Bill's Family Recipe",
    "MV.Municipal.Mail.RH.1": "Howdy, farmer,^   I've got a request for you.^   See, I saw in one of Ras's books that there's this flower that can help keep up the ambient magic in a place. That means it's good for a wizard's magic, takes less effort to get their work done. Ras is the sort of fella to work himself half to death, so I figure it'd be a nice thing for him to have. And Alma ran across a seed for it! Not just that, but a purple one, his favorite color.^   But I'm worried I won't be able to grow it right. I can keep a plant alive fine, but it's a special one that's supposed to be tricky to sprout. Could you help me out? And don't tell Ras, I plan to give it to him for his birthday. I know he's got a winter birthday like I do, so it'll be a while to keep that secret, but I trust you on it. And I don't expect it'd grow in the snow, so I'm gettin' it to you early.   ^   Thanks a ton!  ^   -Bill",
    "MV.Municipal.Mail.Title.RH.1": "A Request",
    "MV.Municipal.Mail.RH.2": "   Greetings, young adept,^   I am in need of your counsel on matters that are outside of my realm of expertise. I must request your presence, at your earliest convenience.  ^   -M. Rasmodius",
    "MV.Municipal.Mail.Title.RH.2": "A Summons",
    "MV.Municipal.Mail.ManaBloom.RH": "   Greetings, young adept,^   I have discovered a way to produce more mana bloom seeds. If you would like to grow more, Krobus has agreed to sell them for me. I have also included a recipe to process these blooms into a form that you can utilize for your own endeavors.  ^ Thank you again for your assistance.  ^   -M. Rasmodius",
    "MV.Municipal.Mail.ManaBloom.Title.RH": "Mana Blooms",
    "MV.Municipal.Mail.ManaBloom.true": "   Greetings, young adept,^   I have discovered a way to produce seeds of a flower called a Mana Bloom. They are a lovely flower that is very useful to my work. If you would like to grow them, Krobus has agreed to sell them for me. I have also included a recipe to process these blooms into a form that you can utilize for your own endeavors.  ^   -M. Rasmodia",
    "MV.Municipal.Mail.ManaBloom.false": "   Greetings, young adept,^   I have discovered a way to produce seeds of a flower called a Mana Bloom. They are a lovely flower that is very useful to my work. If you would like to grow them, Krobus has agreed to sell them for me. I have also included a recipe to process these blooms into a form that you can utilize for your own endeavors.  ^   -M. Rasmodius",
    "MV.Municipal.Mail.ManaBloom.Title": "Mana Blooms",
    //QUESTS
    "MV.Municipal.Quest.Title.RH": "Mana Bloom",
    "MV.Municipal.Quest.Description.RH": "Bill wants to give the Wizard a special gift for his birthday. He's asked for your help to grow it.",
    "MV.Municipal.Quest.Instructions.RH": "Bring Bill a Mana Bloom.",
    "MV.Municipal.Quest.Response.RH": "Oh, this is perfect! He's gonna love it.$h#$b#He's awful cute when he's talkin' bout magic.$4",
    //TOURISTS
    "MV.Municipal.Tourists.Alicia.1": "Oh, hey there!",
    "MV.Municipal.Tourists.Alicia.2": "Good luck getting to wherever you're going!",
    "MV.Municipal.Tourists.SadDuke.1": "Ugggh, what a hangover...",
    "MV.Municipal.Tourists.SadDuke.2": "Please, keep it down...",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.Fair": "Aw man, what a drag.",
    "MV.Municipal.SadDuke": "Jon",
    //FLAVOR TEXT
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.1": "Looks like a package scale.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.2": "Decent enough coffee, for office coffee.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.3": "Sugar and creamer and little disposable paper cups.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.4": "Information on fire safety and fire extinguisher maintenance. Ask at the desk for a fire extinguisher.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.5": "Suggestion box! Fully anonymous!",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.6": "The mail room, for mail carriers only.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.7": "Unisex restrooms.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.8": "A sign that can be flipped around to read if the sheriff is in or out. It indicates that he plans to always be in from 9-11",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.9.false": "A picture of a young girl who doesn't look like Bill at all. Looks like she's won a spelling bee.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.9.true": "A picture of the Bill's daughter when she was very young. Looks like she's won a spelling bee.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.10": "The mug says 'World's Best Second Dad'.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.11": "The sign looks like it once said 'Holding Cells.' A paper sign has been taped over it to read 'Storage.' The door is locked.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.12": "Looks like a gun safe. There's already dust on the dial and handle.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.13": "A whole lot of dull legal texts.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.14": "A bunch of references on local ordinances.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.15": "A police radio. With only one officer, it probably gets limited use.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.16": "Wide drawers for blueprints! Labeled 'Plat Drawers'.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.17": "A bunch of mailing supplies.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.18": "They aren't going to be running out of fire extinguishers any time soon.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.19.false": "Several pictures of a couple, their daughter, and also Bill. Bill has his arm around the father.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.19.true": "All of these are family pictures. Bill looks very happy with his husband, daughter, and daughter's mother.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.20": "A clean bathroom.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.21": "Wow, that's a lot of books. You spot some classical fiction, all the titles you'd expect.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.22": "More books. Some books on history, unions, and civil rights catch your eye.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.23": "Even more books. Many of them are science fiction and fantasy.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.24": "This sea urchin is wearing a cowboy hat!",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.25": "You think you can see another sea urchin under the plants. It appears to be wearing a rock as a hat, making it extremely hard to see.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.26": "A very new game system, connected to the internet.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.27": "A huge bookshelf with a stool to reach the top shelves. There are a few pen and paper RPG books near eye level.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.28": "Looks like an attic access.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.29": "This trash can is empty. Makes sense, nobody lives here right now.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.30": "This building isn't open yet. There's signs of finishing construction inside.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.31": "This looks like an apartment door. Nobody lives here yet.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.32.false": "Sebastian's snow goon. Bill's said that the Municipal lawn is open season for snowmen.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.32.true": "Sebastian and Maru's snow goon. Bill's said that the Municipal lawn is open season for snowmen.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.33": "There's a grocery list and... aw, it looks like the local kids made drawings to welcome Bill to town, and he's put them up with magnets.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.34": "Looks like Bill's in a horror novel mood.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.35": "It's a copy of Elliott's book.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.36": "Looks like a stack of Rodney's books.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.37": "These books are topped by a copy of Elliott's book. Underneath are what appear to be a stack of Rodney's works.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.38": "Light reading, books you can fall asleep to.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.39": "A picture won from Squidfest.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.40": "A trophy fish caught during the Trout Derby.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.41": "The chime Bill bought from Krobus when they first met.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.42": "The sign looks like it once said 'Holding Cells' with an arrow pointing to a door to the right. A paper sign has been taped over it to read 'Storage.' The door is locked.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.43": "Above the radio is a picture of a bird from Ginger Island. Above it is a picture of Leo going to school for the first time.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.44": "A shot of the newly completed Municipal Building.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.45": "A shot of the newly completed Municipal Building. All around it are shots from festivals throughout the year.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.46": "Several shots of Bill with the townspeople and of different events in town.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.47": "Several shots of Bill with the townspeople and of different events in town. To the left of his corkboard is a shot of the Community Center on the day it reopened.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.48": "Some pretty good children's drawings are put up over Bill's bed. The signature reads 'Elena.'",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.49": "A Lupini from the Night Market.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.50": "A little TV turned to the news and a map of Pelican Town.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.51": "Many pamphlets for social services resources. An example is one about free bus rides to Zuzu for therapy and assistance paying for it. Another is a guide for resources for addiction.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.52.false": "This bulletin board has various community notices on it. They're mostly about things like how to get a ride to town with the bus out.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.52.true": "This bulletin board has various community notices on it. With the bus back in operation, things have thinned out.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.53": "Several numbered, locked post office boxes in different sizes.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.54": "This sign indicates that this location is licensed by the Ferngill Post to offer mail services.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.55.false": "This mailbox isn't marked yet.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.55.true": "This is Bill's mailbox. It's shut tight.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.56": "Wanted: Txxxxt Txxxxa Hxxxxxxxe, reward $1000000000. You doubt Bill's aiming to catch anybody with this defaced old poster.",
    "MV.Municipal.Flavor.Wizard": "The flower you grew for Bill to give to Rasmodius. It seems to be preserved somehow, though it still looks alive. And it's glowing softly.",
    //SCHEDULE STRINGS
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.Sleep": "%Bill's dead asleep. Should you really poke a sleeping sheriff?",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.Stakeout": "%Bill appears to be just fishing, but he often glances towards Jojamart. Guess he's keeping an eye on that litter problem.",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.Shopping": "Stoppin' in for some supplies? Me too.",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.Saloon": "The kids round here are pretty good at pool. I never got the hang of it, but I like watchin'.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.Wizard": "Ras really knows some interesting things.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.Guild": "You be careful if you head into the mines, you hear?",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.CC": "You did a damn fine job fixing up this place. A community needs a place to come together.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.BookClub": "Books and fine company, what more could I want?$h#$b#They're not all good books, but those're their own kind a' fun.",
    //CONDITIONAL STRINGS
    "MV.Municipal.SebRocks.true": "...feel like throwing {0} as hard as I can across the lake. Please deliver to Sebastian at 24 Mountain Road.",
    "MV.Municipal.SebRocks.false": "...feel like throwing {0} as hard as I can against the mountain face. Please deliver to Sebastian at 24 Mountain Road.",
    //GENERAL DIALOGUE - note for translators, Bill has a slow, country accent and way of talking. As a reader, he uses some fancy words words, but not frequently
    //DIALOG CHANGES
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.SebSnow.1.false": "I built a snowgoon in front of the municipal building. Sheriff Bill said I could.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.SebSnow.1.true": "Maru and I built a snowgoon in front of the municipal building. Sheriff Bill said we could.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.SebSnow.2.false": "Yeah, that's my snowgoon in front of the municipal building.#$b#Sheriff Bill called it 'community art.'$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.SebSnow.2.true": "Yeah, that's me and Maru's snowgoon in front of the municipal building.#$b#Sheriff Bill called it 'community art.'$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.HaleyDonate": "Maybe I'll donate some of my skirts to the donation box this spring.#$e#I mean, I do have over 1,000 skirts.$h#$e#...what?",
    //Specific Day
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.BillBirthdayBefore": "Hm? Suppose my birthday is tomorrow. Hadn't thought much about it.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.BillBirthday": "Well thank you for the well-wishes! I don't much celebrate my birthday on my own.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.ElliottBirthday": "Found a neat old book on the internet for Elliott's birthday.$h#$b#Even if the book ain't to his taste, it'll look nice on his shelf.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.WillyBirthday": "Got a nice bottle o' mead I've been savin' for Willy's birthday today.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.WizardBirthday": "You know, it's Ras's birthday today. It'd mean more'n [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHe] might admit if you got [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHim] somethin'...",
    //Seasonal
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.spring.1": "How's your plantin' going, @? Suppose you've got plenty of new growth to clear out, too.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.spring.2": "Man, I missed the country air when I was in the city. Nice bein' able to breathe easy.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.spring.3": "Whew, the pollen's really droppin' ain't it? My windows were near yella this mornin'.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.spring.4": "The bees're really out in force today. Had one stubborn fella keep bonkin' into my window.$h#$b#The tap-tap-tap set my nerves off, what with it bein' a second floor window and no tree branches outside it.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.spring.5": "Some good fish bitin' today. Couldn't keep the flounder off the hook this mornin'.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.spring.6": "Cleared out the weeds round some doors and paths early this mornin'.$h#$b#Don't want anybody with mobility issues to trip over all the new growth. Or anyone else, for that matter.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.summer.1": "Make sure to stay hydrated out there! Farmin's sweaty work.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.summer.2": "$query WEATHER Here Sun#Think I'll take a dip later. Wash off some of this heat.|Rain's gonna turn straight to steam in this heat. But least it'll cool things down a bit.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.summer.3": "Careful if you head out to the beach. Don't wanna to lose you to the sea.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.summer.4": "Doin' any fishin' this season? Be careful with the tuna. Caught one this mornin' so big it nearly pulled me in.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.summer.5": "Hey, you mind bein' a spare set of eyes for a second?#$b#It's my damn neck. Have I missed a spot of sunblock back there?",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.summer.6": "Pufferfish season! Gotta admit, I find 'em adorable.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.fall.1": "Glad there's a way up to the roof of the Municipal Building. Makes it easier to clean the leaves outta the gutters.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.fall.2": "Whew! I just got done sweepin' the leaves off the paths and away from the doors. Can be dangerous, slippin' on wet leaves.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.fall.3": "Fall's my favorite season. Love the colors, the leaves, the coolin' air after the hot summer's gone.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.fall.4": "Only thing I don't like 'bout this time of year is eggplant. %revealtaste:MV.Municipal_SheriffBill:272",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.fall.5": "Think I'll catch some salmon later. It's their time of year again.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.fall.6": "Good season for a food bank. Everybody's got plenty comin' in to give.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.winter.1": "Really had to fight a lingcod earlier. That fella did not want to get caught.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.winter.2": "Put out some sand on the paths today. Wouldn't want anybody to slip on the ice.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.winter.3": "Suppose your routine really changes up in winter, don't it? Too cold for most things to grow an' all.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.winter.4": "The kids were out throwin' snowballs earlier. That Vincent's really got an arm on 'im for a little guy.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.winter.5": "Think I need to get some warmer socks. These just ain't cuttin' it today.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.winter.6": "Took Linus some blankets this morning.$h#$b#He's got a pretty good setup in his tent.",
    //Weather
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.rain.1": "It's really comin' down out there, ain't it? Not a dry thread on me.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.rain.2": "Least the weather's gonna make waterin' your crops easier.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.rain.3": "Might need kayaks to get around at this rate. A real gully washer.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.storm.1": "Think Yoba's bowlin' up there in the sky? Reminds me of my first apartment in the city.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.storm.2": "That last strike was a close one! Don't think it hit anything though.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.storm.3": "This mornin', I saw a crack of lightning so bright it lit my room like a sunny day.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.snow.1": "Looks like my snow shovel's gonna get a workout soon. And my diggin' arm.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.snow.2": "At this rate, we might end up snowed in. Been checkin' that everybody's ready for the possibility.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.snow.3": "It might be work cleanin' things up after, but snow fallin's awful pretty.",
    //0-4 hearts
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.1": "Think a raccoon's gettin' into the trashcans. Cute critters, but boy can they make a mess.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.2": "Howdy there. Need anything?#$b#No? Well, that's good. Always a good thing when trouble stays away.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.3": "Still hard to believe how much more peaceful it is out here than in the city.#$b#Guess my nerves got used to bein' real wound up.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.4": "Think Robin's got a new project started. She's a real artist with wood, ain't she?",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.5": "Alicia brought in some new kind of coffee this mornin'. I ain't half bad.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.6": "The fish were really bitin' this morning! You done any fishin' lately?",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.7": "Stardew's startin' to feel like home to me. Hope you're feelin' the same.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.8": "Spent some time lookin' for lost glasses this mornin'. Harvey left 'em in [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:PierreName]'s, it turns out.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.9": "You wouldn't believe what people report to the police. You'd think 'I don't like it' was an arrest-worthy offense.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.10": "I appreciate Maru and Demetrius helpin' me out with my tank.#$b#Was a little worried about getting good aquarium supplies out here, but they've got me covered.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.11": "I've got a few crab traps out, but that just ain't the same as fishin'.#$b#Their catch is good eatin' though.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.12": "You're always welcome to join me at lunch, if you feel like havin' company. I eat at the saloon 'round noon.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.13": "Been readin' any good books lately? I've got this one 'bout a necromancer runnin' a circus that's got me hooked. Elliott recommended it.", // Johannes Cabal the Necromancer
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.14": "I've got a tank of sea urchins. You're welcome to have a look if you like.#$b#They've always been my favorite animal since I was a kid.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.15": "[CapitalizeFirstLetter [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:BillDaughter]] 3D printed a bunch of hats for Steve and Bob.$h#$b#My sea urchins, I mean. Steve and Bob love puttin' on little hats.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.16": "Hm? Yeah, we got a lot of fire extinguishers in the office.$0#$b#I just worry, since y'all ain't got a local fire station or the infrastructure for one.$3#$b#Doin' the best we can with what we got.$0",
    //5+ hearts
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.17": "Evelyn reminds me of my grandma. In a good way.$h#$b#Her cookies ain't the same, but they're just as good.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.18": "Vincent wants to be a cop when he grows up, he says. Told him about all the paperwork and he seems less keen.$h#$b#Which is good. What he thinks is 'cool' about being a cop... just ain't.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.19": "Gus can really cook. Not often you got someone runnin' a restaurant who can make you feel like every meal's homecooked.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.20": "George may be cranky, but I appreciate him not callin' me for everything that makes him mad.#$b#Some people are just like that. If they can't be happy, someone's gotta hurt for it.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.21": "Penny was after me again. Wants me to talk to her class.$3#$b#I don't know what I'd say to 'em that she'd like... but she's so earnest, it's hard to turn 'er down.$0",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.22": "We had a wizard back where I'm from, too. Course, he wasn't like Ras. I think he was just off his rocker.#$b#Sure never saw him do any magic. Just tried to push a lot of essential oils and crackpot supplements.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.23": "Gunther's real excited today. He's got some new books in. Think I'll check out what he's got when I've got a minute.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.24": "[LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MarlonName]'s got so many stories, I don't think [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MarlonGenderHe]'ll ever run out of 'em.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.25": "Willy's elbow started botherin' him again. It's the castin' motion, wears on it a bit.$3#$b#Told 'im he should go to [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:HarveyPhilip] and ask about exercises that'll help it.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.26": "I wish Jodi and Caroline would ease up just a tad.$3#$b#It's easy to be paranoid when you've got a kid, easy to feel like you need to smother 'em to keep 'em safe.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.27": "$query ANY \"PLAYER_NPC_RELATIONSHIP Current Sebastian Married\" \"PLAYER_HAS_SEEN_EVENT Current Kantrip.OlderSebastian_Event_Reconciliation\"#Sebastian seems happier lately. Glad [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:SebHe]'s in a better place in life.|Sebastian was tellin' me about [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:SebHis] work earlier. I don't understand much of it, but I think [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:SebHe] liked havin' someone to listen.#$b#Wish [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:SebHis] home situation was better.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.28": "Sorry if I'm yawnin'. Elena needed to talk out a problem she's been havin', so I stayed up later'n I should.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.29": "I don't miss bar patrol in the city. Had to deal with some of the meanest drunks you've ever met.$3#$b#And they expect a cop to be hard on 'em, so they don't take to talkin' it out well.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.30": "Alma's off on some new adventure again. Livin' her best life. Wish everyone could end up in as good a place as her.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.31": "Think [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:PierreName] and Abigail are feudin' again.$3#$b#I know where [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:AbiShes] comin' from. Some people expect their kids to be one way and don't know what to do when that ain't what they end up with.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.32": "Alex is a good kid, despite his pa. Glad he made good instead a' followin' in his footsteps.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.33": "It must be hard for Penny, seein' her ma struggle like that...$3#$b#Doesn't help that alcohol and strugglin' can give you a short temper.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.34": "I'm glad Elliott followed his dream. Life ain't worth livin' if you never live for yourself even a little.",
    //10 hearts + 10H Event
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.35": "The donation box is doing well. We're doing good work in the community with the money.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.36": "You know, @, if you ever need any help, you've just got to ask. I'm more'n happy to lend a hand, 'specially for a good friend.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.37": "Sometimes I wish my old man coulda seen this place.$3#$b#I know it wouldn't win him over, but there's always that little voice in my head that thinks it could convince 'im there's a better way.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.38": "It's good to live someplace nobody's afraid of me. It's even better bein' able to police in a way that doesn't cause that fear.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.39": "Think I'll be happy growin' old here.$h#$b#Not that I ain't old already, but you know what I mean.$7",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.40": "I'm sure your grandpa'd be damn proud of you if he could see what all you've done.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Daily.41": "Saw Linus using the free pantry earlier. He put in some good forage, got himself some vegetables.#$b#I'm so glad he's willing to use it. I was worried he wouldn't.$h",
    //Monday
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Monday.1": "Got your week planned out? Or you rather just wing it?",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Monday.2": "Mondays don't bother me. My schedule doesn't really do weekends. Suppose yours doesn't either.",
    //Thursday
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Thursday.1": "I aim to bother ol' Ras this evening.$h#$b#Read somethin' in a book I think [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHe]'ll know more about.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Thursday.2": "Don't know how Ras heats that ol' tower, but it always feels fine when I'm there.#$b#Some kind of magic, I suppose. Guess I can always ask [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHim] later.",
    //Friday
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Friday.1": "You headin' to the saloon this evening? Think I will.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Friday.2": "Gets awful crowded in the saloon in Fridays, don't it? It's nice to have everyone around, though.",
    //Saturday
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Saturday.1": "Think I'll stop by [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MarlonName]'s today. Seems like a [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MarlonFella] could get lonely up on that mountain, even if [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MarlonGenderHe] won't admit it.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Saturday.2": "Promised I'd have a drink with Gil an' [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MarlonName] at the guild today.#$b#That Gil's really somethin'. If you can catch 'im awake, that is. Funnier'n you'd expect.$h",
    //Sunday
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Sunday.1": "Suppose it's that time again. Time for the weekly grocery run.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Sunday.2": "Stopped by [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:PierreName]'s today. They've got some really good produce comin' down from your farm!",
    //Event Specific
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Kent": "Saw Kent and Vincent playin' ball earlier. Nice to see him havin' a good moment like that after all he's been through.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Krobus": "I worry 'bout Krobus in that dank sewer, but he says it's his ideal climate.#$b#Guess it's hard not to think of him as a little human guy.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Sandy": "Must be lonely out in the desert. Hope Sandy's bein' paid well enough to deal with that isolation.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Leo": "Leo's settlin' in well. Was worried he'd have a harder time, but Stardew's got some good kids.#$b#And he's got Linus now. Glad Linus has someone now too, if I'm honest.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.RH.1": "Me an' Ras are just gonna take things as they come.#$b#Ain't like we want anything with a time limit, like havin' kids.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.RH.2": "Ras says this amulet's protective. Enchanted it himself.$h",
    //MOD SPECIFIC
    //SVE
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.SVE.1": "$query IS_COMMUNITY_CENTER_COMPLETE#Maybe with Joja gone, Andy'll realize they weren't makin' anything better.|I understand Andy's situation is frustrating, but I ain't sure he's throwin' blame in the right direction.$3#$b#Unfortunately, it's easier to get people to work against their own interests than you'd think. Reminds me of home...$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.SVE.2": "$query PLAYER_HAS_MAIL Current ccMovieTheater#Glad Claire's new job is suitin' her better.#$b#You'd think checkout to checkout would be a side-grade, but Joja must a' been brutal.$3|Poor Claire. That job of hers is eatin' her up inside.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.SVE.3": "$query PLAYER_HAS_SEEN_EVENT Current 8185295#Nice seein' Sophia around as anything but a pink streak runnin' away.|Girl who runs the winery's awful shy. Skitters away from me like a mouse if I get near.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.SVE.4": "$query PLAYER_HAS_SEEN_EVENT Current 2000003#Bridge buildin's an important job, figurative or otherwise. I knew Victor'd find somethin'.|Ain't easy to pull a job outta thin air. I'm sure Victor will figure somethin' out.",
    //Ridgeside
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Ridgeside.1": "The Amethynes? I don't make a habit of judgin' people based on their name or family.#$b#Seems like it's left most of that bunch wound up so tight they could turn coal to diamonds anyhow.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Ridgeside.2": "Trinnie named the plant in my office. So next time you drop by, say hello to 'Officer Andrew.'$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Ridgeside.3": "Carmen's good company on the docks, but I hope she's really doin' alright. Can't be easy goin' it alone like that.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Ridgeside.4": "$query PLAYER_HAS_SEEN_EVENT Current 75160113#Saw Yuuma playin' with the other kids earlier. Glad he's got at least a bit of time to be a kid.|Don't spread it around, cuz there ain't much can be done 'bout it, but Yuuma makes me damn sad.$3#$b#A kid that young shouldn't have to play caretaker. It's hard enough for adults.$8",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Ridgeside.5": "$query PLAYER_HAS_SEEN_EVENT Current 75160171#Saw Shiro earlier, and he wasn't lookin' half bad! Glad that new therapy's workin' out.|Poor Shiro's got it hard. Hurts to feel like a burden, especially on your own kin.$8",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Ridgeside.6": "Mm. Someone might wanna teach that Keahi 'bout the right way to do a prank.$3#$b#Need to make sure both you and the target are laughin' at the end, or it could go real bad real fast.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Ridgeside.7": "$query PLAYER_HAS_SEEN_EVENT Current 75160374#Louie's a bit rough in the manners department, but I know a maladjusted kid when I see one.$3#$b#He'll get better now that he's out and interactin' with other kids. Gotta learn that by doing.|Louie's a bit rough in the manners department, but I know a maladjusted kid when I see one.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Ridgeside.Naomi": "Not surprised Shiro and Yuuma are as driven as they are after meetin' their ma. They must get it from her.",
    //Sunberry
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Sunberry.1": "The bunnies in Sunberry's woods are the tamest I've ever seen. Downright pettish.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Sunberry.2": "Diala's a good sort, but I wish she'd stop buggin' me about gettin' a reading.$3#$b#I spent enough time with other people tellin' me how to live my life. Ain't gonna add cards or stars to the list.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Sunberry.3": "I oughta get down to the cat cafe more often. Pettin' a cat's good for the soul.$h",
    //Ripley
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Ripley.1": "Nah, me an' Ripley, we ain't from the same neck a' the woods. Different regions.#$b#She's from the mountains. I'm from the low, swampy country.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Ripley.2": "Not sure Ripley ever rests. She's about as busy as you are.",
    //Wren
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Wren.1": "Wren's got a good head on 'er shoulders. Hard-won, from what I hear.#$b#Suppose gender makes fools of us all, least 'til we figure it out for ourselves.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Wren.2": "Every time I pass by Wren, she hits me with a joke worse than the last. Think she's got a book of 'em somewhere?$h",
    //Jonghyuk and Spanner
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Jonghyuk.1": "That Jonghyuk's built like a statue. Think he could snap me in half with one hand.#$b#Real nice fella though, so I think my spine's safe.$7",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Jonghyuk.2": "Spanner's a good kid underneath. Despite the accidental arson.#$b#Lotta kids like him back in the city. The system's failed 'em, so they gotta get by however they can.$3",
    //East Scarp
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.EastScarp.1": "Jacob's a good fella.#$b#Don't know if I'd a' done half as well if I lost [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:BillHusband] when [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:BillDaughter] was still young...$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.EastScarp.2": "Eloise is a bright kid. Really schooled me on the difference between purple and house finches.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.EastScarp.3": "Sometimes think Aideen mighta read too many books... but then I realize, what do I care? Whatever makes her happy.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.EastScarp.4": "That Jasper's got some interesting theories. Bit wild, but his explanations are pretty compellin'.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.EastScarp.RJ": "Rosa an' Juliet're awful cute together. Glad they found each other.$h",
    //Eli and Dylan
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.EnD.1": "I swear, Eli can get into anything. Don't know how that boy gets into half the places I see 'im.#$b#S'like the sheer power of Trouble can get him anywhere he probably shouldn't be.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.EnD.2": "Dylan's a quiet one, but he really knows his stuff. Gave me some tips on local corals that'd be safe for my tank.",
    //Metalcore
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.MGC.1": "Love Cambria's look. Don't know anything about style really, but I love a good tattoo.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.MGC.2": "Cambria's got some odd taste in food, but I can't fault her on her taste in drinks.#$b#I like a good mead myself.$h %revealtaste:MV.Municipal_SheriffBill:459",
    //Nora
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Nora.1": "I do like when Nora talks about reptiles. Her passion for 'em really shines through.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Nora.2": "You met Nora's Pinkie Pie and Stupid yet? They're good little critters.$h",
    //Bear Family
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.BearFam.1": "$query PLAYER_HAS_SEEN_EVENT Current MadDog.BearFam.16199000#Teren's a damn fine cook. Vets I talk to used to rant about how bad army food was, but I guess he solved that one himself.|Sondra's turned into the whole town's aunt in no time flat.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.BearFam.2": "$query PLAYER_HAS_SEEN_EVENT Current MadDog.BearFam.16191111#Sig's got some fine bees down there. Wouldn't expect a basement's a good place for 'em, but what do I know.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.BearFam.3": "Sondra's turned into the whole town's aunt in no time flat.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.BearFam.4": "$query PLAYER_HAS_SEEN_EVENT Current MadDog.BearFam.16194000#Gudrun's got a good head on 'er shoulders.$h#$b#Maybe a bit strict on fishin', but she's got the right attitude to hold strong in a protest.|Sondra's turned into the whole town's aunt in no time flat.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.BearFam.5": "$query PLAYER_HAS_SEEN_EVENT Current MadDog.BearFam.16193000#Gunnar's a good kid, despite what people say. He's always willin' to help.|Sondra's turned into the whole town's aunt in no time flat.$h",
    //The Promise of Choice
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.TPoC.1": "Been goin' to the widow's book club Aliyah's set up. It's nice bein' around people who understand.#$b#And the books are a plus, too.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.TPoC.2": "Your friend Dahlia's a lot. But... it's a cute 'a lot', you know? She's like a hummingbird, flittin' round.",
    //The Garden Cottage
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.TGC.1": "Father Joseph reminds me of a history teacher I had as a kid. Gives good advice, easy to like.#$b#Sly old fella, too, when it pleases him.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.TGC.2": "You watch out for that goose, now. Those can be nasty and territorial when they please.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.TGC.3": "$query PLAYER_HAS_SEEN_EVENT Current AvianRPG.TheGardenCottage_EventTwinsArrive#Those grandkids of Father Joseph's are a real pair of spitfires. Maybe he could use a couple leashes...|Father Joseph was showin' me pictures of his grandkids earlier. A couple of cute little fellas.",
    //Lurking in the Dark Alpha
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.LitD.1": "Alright, I gotta ask, what's with the snails?$9#$b#Found this in my mailbox this morning. It's a mailbox, not a snailbox. [7thAxis.LitD_Items.VoidLavaSnail]",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.LitD.2": "I sure hope all those little snails won't get as big as that big one over in East Scarp...$10",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.LitD.3": "Hope the snails don't bother your crops.#$b#If you had to fight a war against that many snails, I don't think you'd be the one winning.",
    //Downhill Project
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Downhill.1": "Anderson's a good sort.#$b#Our pastor back home used his position for his own ends.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Downhill.2": "Poor Julia. Can be rough to lose memories of people you love. My grandma couldn't remember my name toward the end.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.Downhill.3": "Arthur's a real spitfire. Guess you need that kinda energy to do hard work in a coal mine.",
    //Adventurer's Guild Expanded
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.AGE.1": "[LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MarlonName]'s proud of [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MarlonGenderHe] niece and nephew, and I can't blame [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MarlonGenderHim]. They're good kids.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.AGE.2": "People talk about how Zinnia's just like her ma, but Gabe's sure got her mind for research.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.AGE.3": "Both Zinnia and Gabe put everything into what they do. [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MarlonName] couldn't ask for more dedicated help.",
    //Joja Movie Theater and Super Jojamart
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.JojaMT.1": "Now that Joja's away from the river, the litter problem's gone down. Small favors, I guess.",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.JojaMT.2": "You know, there's an empty Jojamart and an empty Super Jojamart back where I'm from. Joja kept the land the Super Jojamart was on.$3#b#Why? Real estate nonsense. Leasing agreements. If they can squeeze a penny outta the place, they will.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Dialogue.JojaMT.3": "$query PLAYER_HAS_MAIL Host ccMovieTheaterJoja#Glad you got a theater in here. Still can tell what it used to be of course, but it's kinda charmin' in a way.#b#Reminds you how life goes on, even after Jojamart.|'Course Joja leaves the old building to rot when they find a bigger place.$3#b#They leave those ugly things behind like hermit crab shells, if a hermit crab shell was too big for any other hermit crab.$3",
    //MOVIE DIALOGUE
    "MV.Municipal.GenericMovie.1": "Haven't heard of this one before.",
    "MV.Municipal.GenericMovie.2": "Bill focuses on the movie, not making any disruptive noise.",
    "MV.Municipal.GenericMovie.3": "That wasn't half bad.",
    "MV.Municipal.Mysterium.1": "Nobody seems to know what the heck this one's about.",
    "MV.Municipal.Mysterium.2": "Huh...",
    "MV.Municipal.Mysterium.3": "No idea what happened, but I think I liked watchin' it.",
    "MV.Municipal.NaturalWonders.1": "Can't go wrong with a good nature piece, right? Always somethin' nice to look at.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.NaturalWonders.2": "Bill falls quiet in wonder at the scenes.",
    "MV.Municipal.NaturalWonders.3": "It's amazin', the places things can live.",
    "MV.Municipal.PrairieKing.1": "I do love a good western.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.PrairieKing.2": "Heh, good luck with that.",
    "MV.Municipal.PrairieKing.3": "Quick thinkin' on his part, slowin' down that avalanche.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Wumbus.1": "What is a Wumbus anyway?",
    "MV.Municipal.Wumbus.2": "Bill's eyes are glazed over.",
    "MV.Municipal.Wumbus.3": "Well... that sure was a movie.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.ItHowlsInTheRain.1": "This looks like it might be the kind of horror I can like.",
    "MV.Municipal.ItHowlsInTheRain.2": "Bill never jumps, but his eyebrow shoots up at points.",
    "MV.Municipal.ItHowlsInTheRain.3": "That wasn't half bad.",
    "MV.Municipal.MiracleAtColdstarRanch.1": "People seem real excited about this one.",
    "MV.Municipal.MiracleAtColdstarRanch.2": "Bill's not frowning, but he's doing something pretty close to it.",
    "MV.Municipal.MiracleAtColdstarRanch.3": "Well, that was a bit too schmaltzy for me. Felt artificial.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.ZuzuExpress.1": "This one's a real classic. You ever seen it before?",
    "MV.Municipal.ZuzuExpress.2": "Bill wipes a tear away.",
    "MV.Municipal.ZuzuExpress.3": "That ending gets me every time. I'd like to think she made the right choice after it.",
    "MV.Municipal.ThiefOfJustice.1": "Can't miss supportin' our local movie star, can I?",
    "MV.Municipal.ThiefOfJustice.2": "Bill grins as Claire enters the scene.",
    "MV.Municipal.ThiefOfJustice.3": "She's really got talent. Glad someone in the right business noticed it.",
    //GIFT DIALOGUE
    //Generic
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.love": "For me? That's just what I needed! Thanks!$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.like": "Well now, ain't that nice? Thanks for thinking of me!$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.neutral": "Just felt like gift givin'? Well, thanks!",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.dislike": "Can't say that's one of my favorite. Thanks anyway. $u",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.hate": "That's... Not sure why you're giving me that, but it's the thought that counts, I suppose. $u",
    //Birthday
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.Gift.WinterStar.Before": "Guess you're stuck with me for your gift-giver. Hope you like it.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.Gift.WinterStar.After": "Just a little somethin' that made me feel of you. Have a nice season.",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.Gift.Receive.Book": "I'm gonna head home this evenin' and curl up with this next to the fire. Thank you, farmer.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.Gift.Receive.Tackle": "Just in time to get in some more fishin' before the season's out. You know me well.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.Gift.Receive.General": "Thanks for thinkin' of me, farmer. This is real nice.$h",
    //Winter Star
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.birthday.love": "That's a damn thoughtful gift! Thanks for remembering my birthday.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.birthday.like": "Well now, ain't that nice? Thanks for remembering my birthday.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.birthday.neutral": "It's good've you to remember my birthday.",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.birthday.dislike": "Well, at least you remembered my birthday, even if it ain't my favorite. Thanks anyway. $u",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.birthday.hate": "That's... Well, that's an interesting choice of gift. $u",
    //Specific
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.stardroptea": "Wow, you sure? Don't know how they make this stuff taste so good to everyone.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.urchin": "Aw, what a good little guy! Look at the color on those spines!$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.gaystamp": "I'm always happy to get one of these! The charity these are for is one of my favorites.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.fishing": "Oh, that's perfect! How'd you know I was about to pick up some of this at Willy's?$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.books": "Don't think I've read this one yet! I'll put it next on my reading list.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.TheTarotRevealed": "Well... I suppose it could be interesting. Ain't really somethin' I'm into.",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.cocktails": "Fellas at the precinct used to tease me for liking fruity cocktails. More for me if they don't like 'em.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.fancymead": "That's a damn fine mead! I look forward to havin' it later.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.mead": "I'll always take a mead over beer! %revealtaste:MV.Municipal_SheriffBill:346 $h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.sweetdrinks": "You've got me. I've got a hell of a sweet tooth, 'specially with drinks.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.cola": "Suppose I could use somethin' to wet my throat. Thanks!",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.poppy": "Don't see why people are so down on these. It's a nice flower. Useful, too!$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.protect": "I don't aim to be in a position to need this, but it's nice've you to think of my safety.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.spurs": "Guess you figured a sheriff should have a pair of these, huh? Ain't got a horse to go with 'em, though.",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.tackle": "Ah, perfect timing. Mine just broke. Maybe I'll have to go fishing later.",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.useful": "Well now, that'll come in handy! Thanks!",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.ricepud": "Mm, [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:BillMother] always made these. Never were my favorite. But thanks for the effort cookin' it.$u",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.beer": "Never much liked the taste of beer, I'm afraid.$u",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.eggplant": "I gotta admit, I always hated eggplant.$u",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.eggplantfood": "I gotta admit, I always hated eggplant. But thanks for the effort cookin' it.$u",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.weapons": "Now why on earth would you give me a fool thing like that?$u",
    //Specific (From mods)
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.GingerBeer": "I was just thinking about this little place in Zuzu that made ginger beer. You've read my mind.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.GaylacticCookie": "Now that's a fine cookie. Thanks!$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.PridePop": "Ha, haven't had one of these since I was a kid, and the theme's on point. Thanks!$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.ArcanaCatcherPrunus": "Oh! I read this to [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:BillDaughter] when she was little!$h#$b#Don't matter what I thought of it. All that matter is how wide she smiled when I read it.",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.RealAutograph": "Oh! I'll have to show this to [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:BillDaughter], she'll love it.",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.BookofYoba": "Ah... Well, thank you. Afraid I've been given ten of these though.",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.GettingChicksToLoveYou": "You know, I might not be the target audience for this one.#$b#I'm kidding, I'm kidding. I like chickens just fine.$7",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.GuideToSculptingWithGold": "Must not be easy if you gotta specialize. Or maybe it is easy, since it's a soft metal? Huh, well now I'm curious.",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.Cider": "I do love a good cider. Especially in the right season.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.PotentMead": "Whew! Think I'll save this one for a day off.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.GunnarPotion": "Give it to me straight: will this one blow me up?$u",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.Colacrab": "Well, at least somebody's having a good time with litter in the water.$u",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.BearfamCoffee": "I'll always take a good coffee. Especially if it's sweetened up.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.BearfamSavory": "Well, there's my dinner settled! If I can keep from eating it 'til then.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.BearfamCaritas": "That Teren's got a real gift. Glad he's found a place to use it.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.Marimo": "I love these little guys. Put googly eyes on 'em and you've got a great aquarium piece.$h#$b#Course I think my urchins would eat it, so I'll refrain.",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.Scolymia": "A Scolymia! What a beauty! I'll have to introduce this to that bare spot in my tank.$h#$b#My urchins are reef-safe, you know. Introduced basic coral gently and checked just in case.",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.roastedcoffee": "These are some damn fine beans.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.elderlilymead": "Hmm... An interesting taste. Not sure I'd want to try it more than once. Bit intense.",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.elderlilydrink": "Whew! Might need to stop off at Harvey's after that. Way too intense.",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.voidtainted": "Think there's something wrong with this one.$u",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.coffeemead": "Coffee and mead? Damn, sign me right on up,$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.sparklingmead": "It's unusual, but you know, I like it.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.GotoranCoffee": "That's a fine cup of coffee. Gotoran, you say?$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.Cornucopia_Ambrosia": "My grandma used to make this when I was little. That takes me back.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.Cornucopia_BananaBread": "I'd never turn down a good banana bread.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.Cornucopia_SweetCinnamon": "Oh, I love cinnamon... and sweets. You've got me there.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.FlavoredBeer": "Never much liked the taste of beer, I'm afraid. The flavorin' don't make it better.$u",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.Snakerdoodle": "Hey, that's cute! Not a fan of snake meat myself, but I think I'll take a snake sweet.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.FriedTomatoes": "My grandma used to make this when I was little. She'd pick 'em green from her garden and fry 'em up.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.CowboyChili": "Ahh, this is the one place I can stand beer. A splash in chili, where it belongs.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.HushPuppies": "Can't have fish without some a' these! Thank you!$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SheriffBill.gift.BiscuitandGravy": "Well, that's my breakfast settled! This was always my favorite.$h",
    //NPC GIFT DIALOG
    "MV.Municipal.Elliott.gift.stamps": "Thank you, my friend! Between personal letters and the publishing business, I am always out of stamps.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Wizard.gift.manabloom": "Ah! Thank you. These blooms are always useful... and pleasant to look at.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Wizard.gift.manaelixir": "You have done well in brewing this elixir! It shall be quite useful in my work.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Dwarf.gift.shadowlike": "...I suppose that is a nice likeness.",
    //FESTIVAL DIALOGUE
    "MV.Municipal.EggFestivalDialogue.1": "[CapitalizeFirstLetter [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:BillDaughter]] was an egg-finding fiend. Never beaten in our competition back home.#$b#But then she'd give out half her eggs to kids who didn't get so many.",
    "MV.Municipal.EggFestivalDialogue.2": "I know where all the eggs are. Watched 'em to make sure none would get left behind and rot.#$b#Don't ask me to snitch. You'll have to find 'em the old fashioned way.$7",
    "MV.Municipal.EggFestivalDialogue.3": "I did some extra cleaning before the hunt.#$b#Don't want any kids to find sharp trash when they look for eggs.",
    "MV.Municipal.EggFestivalDialogue.Ras.1": "There are many sorts of celebrations to celebrate the earth's fertility.#$b#This festival has deep roots.",
    "MV.Municipal.EggFestivalDialogue.Ras.2": "I understand the rabbit being a symbol of fertility, but I do not understand the connection to eggs.",
    "MV.Municipal.EggFestivalDialogue.Ras.3": "I do like these candies. What are they called? Jelly beans?",
    "MV.Municipal.FlowerDanceDialogue.1": "Don't feel bad if you can't get someone to dance with you.#$b#I couldn't either when I was young.",
    "MV.Municipal.FlowerDanceDialogue.2": "We had something like this at home. It's real... traditional.$u",
    "MV.Municipal.FlowerDanceDialogue.3": "I think it'd be nicer if the kids could wear what they wanted.",
    "MV.Municipal.FlowerDanceDialogue.RH.1": "Actually havin' a date for one of these is pretty nice.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.FlowerDanceDialogue.RH.2": "Ain't usually interested in things this... you know, traditional.#$b#But it's worth comin' just to make Ras blush.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.FlowerDanceDialogue.RH.3": "Nice view from up here. Just about looks like a field o' flowers.",
    "MV.Municipal.FlowerDanceDialogue.Ras.1": "The flowers are quite lovely today.$4",
    "MV.Municipal.FlowerDanceDialogue.Ras.2": "I haven't attended something like this in... I have no idea when.$4",
    "MV.Municipal.FlowerDanceDialogue.Ras.3": "Oh, I would only make a fool of myself if I tried to dance.$4",
    "MV.Municipal.LuauDialogue.1": "The Governor keeps tryin' to puff me up over my 'service.'$u#$b#I don't think he'd like what I have to say about his.$u",
    "MV.Municipal.LuauDialogue.2": "It's 'Avoid the Governor' day again. At least the food's good.$u",
    "MV.Municipal.LuauDialogue.3": "I'd like this festival better if it weren't a political photo-op.$u",
    "MV.Municipal.LuauDialogue.RH.1": "The Governor keeps tryin' to puff me up over my 'service.'$u#$b#I don't think he'd like what I have to say about his.$u#$b#Ah well. Makin' the best of it over here.",
    "MV.Municipal.LuauDialogue.RH.2": "It's 'Avoid the Governor' day again. At least the food's good.$u#$b#The other company ain't that bad either.",
    "MV.Municipal.LuauDialogue.RH.3": "I'd like this festival better if it weren't a political photo-op.$u#$b#But it's nice enough over this end.",
    "MV.Municipal.LuauDialogue.10.1": "Think anyone'd mind if I took a dip?#$b#It's awful hot out here with all this cooking.",
    "MV.Municipal.LuauDialogue.10.2": "I'm glad Linus joined us. He's part of the community, too.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.LuauDialogue.10.3": "I actually had a nice chat with the Governor about some of our community initiatives.#$b#It's easier to talk about that kind of thing when you can show how it works.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.LuauDialogue.Ras.1": "Bill feels obligated to attend this community event despite the politics.#$b#He has asked that I refrain from cursing the governor, though I believe he appreciated the offer.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.LuauDialogue.Ras.2": "The element of fire flourishes in the summer.#$b#...but personally, I do not enjoy this heat.",
    "MV.Municipal.LuauDialogue.Ras.3": "The excellent food is worth the inconvenience of sand in my sandals. And on the hem of my robe.#$b#...Perhaps I do lack appropriate beach attire.",
    "MV.Municipal.LuauDialogue.Ras.4": "I am pleased that the governor has at least agreed to listen to Bill's ideas.#$b#Perhaps I am biased, but I believe that they are good ones.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.MoonlightJelliesDialogue.1": "I've seen pictures of this before. Always wanted to see the real thing.",
    "MV.Municipal.MoonlightJelliesDialogue.2": "Glad the weather's stayed clear for this. I'd hate for it to rain and hide the show.",
    "MV.Municipal.MoonlightJelliesDialogue.3": "You know, Ras calls these Lunaloos. [CapitalizeFirstLetter [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHe]] says they've got some magic in 'em.#$b#As pretty as they are, I'm inclined to believe [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHim].$h",
    "MV.Municipal.MoonlightJelliesDialogue.Ras": "I thought I was well-hidden, but both you and Bill seem to have found me.#$b#I'm here to observe the Lunaloos... or 'Moonlight Jellies', as you call them. They possess an unusually potent magical aura for an aquatic life form.",
    "MV.Municipal.MoonlightJelliesDialogue.Ras.1": "I'm here to observe the Lunaloos... or 'Moonlight Jellies', as you call them. They possess an unusually potent magical aura for an aquatic life form.",
    "MV.Municipal.MoonlightJelliesDialogue.Ras.2": "I may have made sure that the weather would be favorable for the Lunaloos and their arrival.#$b#It would have been a shame for their beauty to go unappreciated.",
    "MV.Municipal.MoonlightJelliesDialogue.Ras.3": "I do not enjoy crowds. I will move closer to observe once the Lunaloos arrive.",
    "MV.Municipal.FairDialogue.1": "Don't worry about the competition too much.#$b#As long as you did your best, we're all damn proud of you.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.FairDialogue.2": "Alex has been asking about my routine since I won the strength game.#$b#I just work out for my health and my job, but I love his enthusiasm.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.FairDialogue.3": "Now you wouldn't like it if someone came into your home drunk and threw trash on your floor, would ya?",
    "MV.Municipal.SpiritsEveDialogue.1": "Heck of a maze. Guess ol' Ras can have a bit of fun with [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHis] magic.",
    "MV.Municipal.SpiritsEveDialogue.2": "Hey there, just one more thing...#$b#Good luck at the maze. $7",
    "MV.Municipal.SpiritsEveDialogue.3": "Don't much like the cages, but I suppose [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MarlonName] knows what [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MarlonGenderHe]'s doing.",
    "MV.Municipal.SpiritsEveDialogue.Ras.1": "On this night of the year, the spirits find their strongest foothold in the mundane realm.",
    "MV.Municipal.SpiritsEveDialogue.Ras.2": "People are willing to believe that my spells are simply tricks on a night like this.",
    "MV.Municipal.SpiritsEveDialogue.Ras.3": "The maze is hardly difficult to create for a wizard of my calibre. But the details do require a level of artistry.",
    "MV.Municipal.IceFestivalDialogue.1": "Me? Nah, I'm sittin' this one out.#$b#Figure I'll give you kids a chance, since it's a proper competition.$7",
    "MV.Municipal.IceFestivalDialogue.2": "You see those ice sculptures? All that beautiful work, just to melt away.",
    "MV.Municipal.IceFestivalDialogue.3": "Good batch of snowmen this year. The snowgoons are my favorites.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.IceFestivalDialogue.Ras.1": "The ephemeral nature of snow sculpting is quite captivating.",
    "MV.Municipal.IceFestivalDialogue.Ras.2": "I find the world blanketed in snow to be quite peaceful.",
    "MV.Municipal.IceFestivalDialogue.Ras.3": "If you get too cold, step closer. I've cast a spell of warming.",
    "MV.Municipal.WinterStarDialogue.1": "Hard not to love the Winter Star.$h#$b#I'm going to spend the evening on video chat with my daughter.",
    "MV.Municipal.WinterStarDialogue.2": "[CapitalizeFirstLetter [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:BillDaughter]] and [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:BillMotherHM] are traveling this year.#$b#They've sent some great pictures of the ski slopes.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.WinterStarDialogue.3": "I love how excited the kids get.$h#$b#It's hard not to catch that energy.",
    "MV.Municipal.WinterStarDialogue.Ras.1": "Ah, the mysterious Winter Star. One of the reasons I chose this valley as the location for my work.#$b#I seem to have found more than the wisdom I sought here.$4",
    "MV.Municipal.WinterStarDialogue.Ras.2": "I have spoken to Bill's daughter and her mother. I am glad that he has true family who cares for him.#$b#Unlike the family that he was born into.$5",
    "MV.Municipal.WinterStarDialogue.Ras.3": "[LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:WinterStarRas] Their joy can be quite infectious.",
    "MV.Municipal.RidgesideGatheringDialogue.1": "I don't get up here much. There ain't enough of me to patrol both Ridgeside and Pelican Town.#$b#They got their own way of doing things anyhow.",
    "MV.Municipal.RidgesideGatheringDialogue.2": "Nice to catch up with the people here.$h#$b#Some of 'em don't get to town often, so I hardly see 'em.",
    "MV.Municipal.RidgesideGatheringDialogue.3.true": "Not really interested in the 'war between the sexes' bit. Had enough of that kind of thing back home.$u#$b#I bought from the nonbinary stall instead.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.RidgesideGatheringDialogue.3.false": "Not really interested in the 'war between the sexes' bit.#$b#Had enough of that kind of thing back home.$u",
    "MV.Municipal.EmberOfResolutionsDialogue.1": "Hm? Sorry, my head's miles away. Just thinkin' bout [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:BillDaughter].$u",
    "MV.Municipal.EmberOfResolutionsDialogue.2": "[CapitalizeFirstLetter [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:BillHusband]] loved... well, he loved the idea of camping anyway. Not the isolation.#$b#Caught on fire the one time he tried to set a bonfire.",
    "MV.Municipal.EmberOfResolutionsDialogue.3": "Good to see the community together like this.$h#$b#I hope your farm keeps doing well next year.",
    "MV.Municipal.EmberOfResolutionsDialogue.RH.1": "Nights like this get me all nostalgic.#$b#Wish I could tell the kid I was that it'd all be alright one day.",
    "MV.Municipal.EmberOfResolutionsDialogue.RH.2": "This place's given me a lot to be thankful for, you know?",
    "MV.Municipal.EmberOfResolutionsDialogue.RH.3": "Good to see the community together like this.$h#$b#I hope your farm keeps doing well next year.",
    "MV.Municipal.EmberOfResolutionsDialogue.Ras": "This ritual has no true magic to it. However, tradition can be its own magic.",
    "MV.Municipal.VioletMoonDialogue.1": "I love this kind of thing. Was the only kid into it when I was young.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.VioletMoonDialogue.2": "I was dungeon master for [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:BillDaughter] and her friends when they were young.$h#$b#I got a good head for rememberin' rules.",
    "MV.Municipal.VioletMoonDialogue.3": "I usually prefer a good mead, but that cider's pretty good too. %revealtaste:MV.Municipal_SheriffBill:DN.SnS_Hand_Pressed_Apple_Cider",
    "MV.Municipal.FireworksFestivalDialogue.1": "Fireworks ain't legal where I'm from. A classmate'd always get some crackers from someplace else and we'd set 'em off anyway.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.FireworksFestivalDialogue.2": "Be careful if you cook these up yourself. Wouldn't want you to blow a finger off.",
    "MV.Municipal.FireworksFestivalDialogue.3": "I brought a couple extinguishers from the municipal building, just in case. Stowed em on the fireworks ship.",
    "MV.Municipal.FashionShowDialogue.1": "I'm going to bring Ras back some snacks during the show.#$b#[CapitalizeFirstLetter [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHe]] acts all mysterious, but look at [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHim]. [CapitalizeFirstLetter [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHe]] loves [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHis] aesthetics.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.FashionShowDialogue.2": "I don't really know anything about fashion. Just here to support everyone.#$b#Food ain't bad either.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.FashionShowDialogue.3": "Emily asked me to model. Thinks my self-expression might be stifled by wearing my uniform all the time.#$b#I'm not really bothered by it, though. I dress for comfort and utility. Fashion's dead last on the list.",
    "MV.Municipal.ReveillonDialogue.1": "Fireworks ain't legal where I'm from. A classmate'd always get some crackers from someplace else and we'd set 'em off anyway.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.ReveillonDialogue.2": "Good to see the community together like this.$h#$b#I hope your farm keeps doing well next year.",
    "MV.Municipal.ReveillonDialogue.3": "It's a fine view of the valley up here. Perfect place for fireworks.",
    "MV.Municipal.ReveillonDialogue.RH.1": "Nights like this get me all nostalgic.#$b#Wish I could tell the kid I was that it'd all be alright one day.",
    "MV.Municipal.ReveillonDialogue.RH.2": "This place's given me a lot to be thankful for, you know?",
    "MV.Municipal.ReveillonDialogue.RH.3": "Good to see the community together like this.$h#$b#I hope your farm keeps doing well next year.",
    "MV.Municipal.ReveillonDialogue.Ras": "Alone in my tower, the sound of fireworks irritated me. It is... better to enjoy them with others.",
    "MV.Municipal.LoveFestivalDialogue.RH": "Got myself a reason to attend this year. You have fun, too!$7",
    "MV.Municipal.LoveFestivalDialogue.Ras": "I haven't attended something like this in... I have no idea when.$4",
    //PASSIVE FESTIVAL DIALOGUE
    "MV.Municipal.DesertFestivalDialogue.1": "I went through Emily's booth earlier. [CapitalizeFirstLetter [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:EmilyShe]]'s got a unique sense of style.#$b#The clothes? Jet black with baggy pants. A heat stroke in the makin'.",
    "MV.Municipal.DesertFestivalDialogue.2": "The cactus faces creep me out a bit.$u#$b#Don't think I want a plant that stares at me.",
    "MV.Municipal.DesertFestivalDialogue.3": "That chef makes a mean gumbo.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.TroutDerbyDialogue.1": "Now this is my kind of festival.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.TroutDerbyDialogue.2": "It's nice how people can get prizes just participatin'.",
    "MV.Municipal.TroutDerbyDialogue.3": "It's a damn fine day for fishin'. Get any bites yet?",
    "MV.Municipal.SquidfestDialogue.1": "Catchin' squid takes skill! They're awful clever creatures.",
    "MV.Municipal.SquidfestDialogue.2": "It's nice to see the fishermen back.$h#$b#They got great stories, even if I only believe half of 'em.",
    "MV.Municipal.SquidfestDialogue.3": "I'm always up for a fishin' competition.",
    "MV.Municipal.NightMarketDialogue.1": "[CapitalizeFirstLetter [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:BillDaughter]] loves Lupini.#$b#I got her one've his paintings as a surprise.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.NightMarketDialogue.2": "That submarine is really somethin'!$h#$b#Ain't seen some of the fish down there in pictures even.",
    "MV.Municipal.NightMarketDialogue.3": "You wouldn't think coffee they give away for free'd be that good.",
    "MV.Municipal.NightMarketDialogue.Ras.true": "Gonna give Ras that gift tomorrow. Thanks again for your help gettin' it.",
    "MV.Municipal.NightMarketDialogue.Ras.false": "Think I found the perfect gift for Ras's birthday tomorrow.#$b#The ol' hermit likes being thought of more'n [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHe] lets on.$7",
    "MV.Municipal.CommunityDayDialogue.1": "Hard to think this place was a ruin 'til recently. It's sure full of life now.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CommunityDayDialogue.2": "That's a damn fine fish tank.#$b#Saw the kids watchin' the fish earlier, and they couldn't keep their eyes off it.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CommunityDayDialogue.3": "You know, havin' places where a community can come together cuts down on crime.$h#$b#Bored kids, for example, are easy to convince to do something foolish.",
    "MV.Municipal.JojaDayDialogue": "Joja Day? [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MorrisName] may be tryin' to do right by this town, but that's [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MorrisName], not Joja.$u#$b#I ain't interested in a corporate party.$u",
    "MV.Municipal.PrideDialogue.1": "I ain't here as a cop. The police as an organization don't belong at pride and neither do cops promoting it.",
    "MV.Municipal.PrideDialogue.2": "[CapitalizeFirstLetter [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:BillHusband]] used to get out the leather for Pride. Boots, pants, vest, the whole kit.#$b#He looked damn good in it.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.PrideDialogue.3": "Didn't have anything like this when I was a kid. I'm glad the kids here have it.",
    "MV.Municipal.TwilightFestivalDialogue.1": "I ought to get down here more often. Diala can really bake.",
    "MV.Municipal.TwilightFestivalDialogue.2": "Think I'll stop by Amina's stand. She's a sweet kid.",
    "MV.Municipal.TwilightFestivalDialogue.3": "Ezra helped me find a last second replacement for part of my costume tomorrow.#$b#Damn glad for it.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.BookFairDialogue": "I was just thinkin' that I needed somethin' new to read.$h",
    //FESTIVAL DIALOGUE - ALICIA
    "MV.Municipal.BlockPartyDialogue.1": "Hey, @! Enjoying a taste of Zuzu life?#$b#I'd never miss a block party.",
    "MV.Municipal.BlockPartyDialogue.2": "I may like a quiet workplace, but nothing beats a party in Zuzu.",
    "MV.Municipal.BlockPartyDialogue.3": "I've got a brother and sister here... somewhere.#$b#Oh, they might have had to run. They've both got little kids, they can get overwhelmed easily.",
    //CONDITIONAL DIALOGUE
    "MV.Municipal.Dumpster": "Careful in there. Easy to get hurt on people's trash, and easier to make a mess of someone's yard.",
    "MV.Municipal.HitBySlingshot": "I wouldn't recommend that.$10",
    "MV.Municipal.GreenRain.true": "I spoke to Ras last night. Figured I'd call on an expert.#$b#She says it'll be fine. Might have to visit more often to keep up on this kind of thing.",
    "MV.Municipal.GreenRain.false": "I spoke to Ras while I was over last night and he said it'll be fine. I hope nothin' bad happenin'll calm folks down.",
    "MV.Municipal.GreenRainFinished": "Everybody seems to've accepted the rain now. Good thing, since Ras says it may happen again.",
    "MV.Municipal.GreenRain2": "You know, when people ain't scared out of their minds, this weather's awful pretty.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.FlowerDance_Decline": "Me? Nah, you go have fun with the others. This ain't my scene. Not without a date, anyway.",
    "MV.Municipal.Fair_Judging": "Fingers crossed!",
    "MV.Municipal.Fair_PlayerLost_PurpleShorts": "Don't know what you did, but Lewis is real bent out of shape.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Fair_PlayerLost_Skipped": "Weren't feeling up to it this year? That's alright. You'll get 'em next year.",
    "MV.Municipal.Fair_PlayerLost": "That's alright. You'll get 'em next year.",
    "MV.Municipal.Fair_PlayerWon": "All your hard work's payin' off!$h",
    "MV.Municipal.WinterStar_Before": "Seems like I drew your name from the hat.",
    "MV.Municipal.WinterStar_After": "It ain't much, but I hope you like it.",
    "MV.Municipal.WinterStar_ReceiveGift": "Guess you're stuck with me this year.$7",
    "MV.Municipal.MovieInvitation": "Sure, why not. Popcorn and a movie sounds like a nice way to spend some time.",
    "MV.Municipal.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyInvited": "'Fraid I've already been invited by {0}.",
    "MV.Municipal.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyWatched": "'Fraid I've already been to the movies this week.",
    "MV.Municipal.RejectMovieTicket_DontWantToSeeThatMovie": "Bein' a parent, I saw a lot of kid's movies I didn't much want to see. Think I'll pass.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.RejectBouquet": "Ah. 'Fraid you're not my type. But I'm sure you'll find your someone out there.",
    "MV.Municipal.RejectBouquet.Ras": "Have you forgotten that I am taken?",
    "MV.Municipal.Resort_Entering": "Havin' a bit of a vacation day today. You too?",
    "MV.Municipal.Resort": "Gorgeous beach out here. Water's way warmer'n I expected, too.",
    "MV.Municipal.Resort_Shore": "See that reef out there? Beautiful.",
    "MV.Municipal.Resort_Towel": "Zzz...",
    "MV.Municipal.Resort_Bar": "I love a good Piña Colada. %revealtaste:MV.Municipal_SheriffBill:873 $h",
    "MV.Municipal.Resort_Leaving": "What a day. Better get back to town, though.",
    //DIALOG FOR MOBILE PHONE
    "MV.Municipal.MobilePhoneGreeting.1": "Pelican Town Sheriff- damnit, force o' habit. Howdy there, {0}.",
    "MV.Municipal.MobilePhoneGreeting.2": "Howdy there, {0}. Need somethin'?",
    "MV.Municipal.MobilePhoneGreeting.3": "Howdy there, {0}. Need somethin'?",
    "MV.Municipal.MobilePhoneGreeting.4": "Howdy there, {0}. Need somethin'?",
    "MV.Municipal.MobilePhoneGreeting.5": "Howdy there, {0}. Need somethin'?",
    "MV.Municipal.MobilePhoneGoodBye": "Alright, see ya 'round then.",
    //DIALOG FOR MERCHANT
    "MV.Municipal.Haggle_Ask_SheriffBill": "Howdy! How's {1}$ for this {0}?",
    "MV.Municipal.Haggle_Compromise_SheriffBill": "How's {1} strike you?",
    "MV.Municipal.Haggle_Overpriced_SheriffBill": "That's a bit more'n I can pay for that.",
    "MV.Municipal.Haggle_Success_SheriffBill": "{1}$ works for me. You have a nice day, now!$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Haggle_Fail_SheriffBill": "'Fraid that's too much for me right now. Thanks anyway!",
    "MV.Municipal.Haggle_Ask_ClerkAlicia": "Hey there, farmer! How about {1}$ for this {0}?$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Haggle_Compromise_ClerkAlicia": "Hm... what about {1}?",
    "MV.Municipal.Haggle_Overpriced_ClerkAlicia": "I'm afraid I can't do that price.",
    "MV.Municipal.Haggle_Success_ClerkAlicia": "{1}$ is great! Thanks, farmer!$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Haggle_Fail_ClerkAlicia": "I really can't do that price. Thanks anyway, farmer!",
    //COOKBOOK
    "Any": "(Any)",
    "GOTORecipe": "Go to this recipe.",
    "NotLearned": "You haven't learned this recipe yet.",
    "Question": "???",
    "Ingredients": "Ingredients",
    "Preferences": "Gift Preferences",
    "Love": "loves this",
    "NotMade": "You haven't made this recipe before.",
    "Made": "You've made this recipe at least once.",
    "UnlockConditions": "Unlock Conditions:",
    "SheriffBillRecipes.Title": "Sheriff Bill's Recipes",
    "SheriffBillRecipes.Desc1": "These are recipes Bill remembers from home.",
    "SheriffBillRecipes.Desc2": "(Modder's Note: And from my home, too!)",
    "SheriffBill.Foreword1": "Bill says:",
    "SheriffBill.Foreword2": "I ain't had a great relationship with my home town, but I can't deny the food's good.",
    "BiscuitandGravy.Desc": "My favorite breakfast. Add some bacon and you're set for the morning.",
    "HushPuppies.Desc": "The perfect side for any seafood.",
    "Unlock1": "Recipe 1: 7 hearts with Sheriff Bill.",
    "Unlock2": "Recipe 2: 3 hearts with Sheriff Bill.",
    //DIALOGUE FOR VANILLA CTs
    "MV.Municipal.CT.Joja_Begin": "It's too bad, the old community center bein' sold off.$3#$b#Suppose it's better'n letting the place rot, but... Well, I wonder what coulda been.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.CC_Begin": "Heard you were doin' some work in the old community center. Planning on fixin' it up? Be careful in there.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.CC_Bus": "That bus is gonna help a lot of people, not least of all Pam.$h#$b#A solid public transport system's always a good thing.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.CC_Boulder": "Don't know what makes a boulder up and leave, but it don't seem to have hurt anybody at least.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.CC_Minecart": "Always wanted to zip around in a minecart. Like somethin' in a movie.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.CCPunch": "I can't condone assault, even though [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MorrisGenderHe] had it comin'. But [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MorrisName] didn't ask to press any charges anyhow, so I'm free to not care.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.MovieTheater": "A movie theater, huh? Anything to keep people from being bored.#$b#Boredom really has an affect on drug usage and local crime.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.pamHouseUpgrade": "Mighty generous of you, fixin' up Pam's house. I hope it helps her out.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.pamHouseUpgradeAnon": "Whoever fixed up Pam's house did a real generous thing.#$b#Didn't they?$7",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.WillyCrabs": "I saw the aftermath of the crab situation. Damn if I know where Willy was keepin' all of em'!$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.WonEggHunt": "Good job findin' those eggs! Bet that hat'll come in handy on the farm.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.WonGrange.False": "I knew you could do it!$h#$b#Don't tell ol' Pierre. Seems he's a bit sore over losin'.$7",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.WonGrange.True": "I knew you could do it!$h#$b#Don't tell ol' Piper, just in case she's a bit sore over losin'.$7",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.WonIceFishing": "Damn fine anglin'! Catchin' fish is hard enough without it bein' a race.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.KentHome": "I'm glad Vincent and Sam's dad is back.$h#$b#Poor Vincent's been askin' me about the war since I got here... Was hard to know what to tell 'im.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.elliottGone": "Elliott on tour! Guess Pelican Town's getting its own famous author. Seems like just yesterday he was locked up in that room, scribblin' away.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.haleyCakewalk2": "Damn fine thing Haley did, helpin' those kids. That's good community spirit.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.sebastianFrog2": "I hear Sebastian's got [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:SebHimself] some frogs! Glad to see [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:SebHimShort] so happy.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.Married": "Congratulations! Hope your marriage's even half as happy as mine was.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.married_Elliott": "Congratulations! I suppose Elliott finally got his muse.$h#$b#Hope your marriage's even half as happy as mine was.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.married_Wizard": "Congratulations! [CapitalizeFirstLetter [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHe]] may not think it sometimes, but [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHe] deserves happiness.$h#$b#Hope your marriage's even half as happy as mine was.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.married_Willy": "Congratulations! Guess you really got yourself a catch.$h#$b#Hope your marriage's even half as happy as mine was.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.married_Marlon": "Congratulations! Didn't think anybody could catch the ol' man's eye.$h#$b#Hope your marriage's even half as happy as mine was.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.married_Gil": "Congratulations! Can't believe you got Gil to do a ceremony. He must really be in love.$h#$b#Hope your marriage's even half as happy as mine was.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.married_Morris": "Congratulations! Can't say I get the appeal, but I ain't the one gettin' married, am I?$7#$b#Hope your marriage's even half as happy as mine was.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.married_MarlonNibling": "Congratulations! Guess ol' Marlon's family's gettin' even bigger.#$b#Hope your marriage's even half as happy as mine was.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.LeahArtShow": "Glad Leah's show was a hit. Not surprised, what with her talent!$h#$b#I tried whittlin', but I always ended up cuttin' away mistakes 'til there was nothin' left.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.ElliottReading": "I think Elliott's reading went well! He was nervous 'bout everyone gettin' bored and leaving.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SamShow": "Those kids put on a good show! Got a spare copy of their disk to send to [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:BillDaughter].$h",
    //DIALOGUE FOR TRIGGER ACTION CTs
    "MV.Municipal.CT.RailroadAccessible.false": "Damn Joja. They could drop a rock on your head and expect you to thank 'em for it.$5#$b#Least the railway and mines're both clear now.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.RailroadAccessible.true": "Damn Joja. They could drop a rock on your head and expect you to thank 'em for it.$5#$b#Least the railway and mines're both clear now. And poor Susan can finally get into town!$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.abandonedJojaMartAccessible": "Even the sky hates that eyesore.$h#$b#Though I'm glad the damn thing didn't catch fire.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.ccComplete": "You did some damn fine work on that old community center.$h#$b#Don't know how you did it so quiet, but the place is good as new.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.jojaComplete": "Just remember, was your money that fixed up this town. Not Joja's.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.willyBoatRepaired": "You did good helpin' Willy out. He's so happy he could burst over his ship bein' in one piece again.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.islandResortUnlocked": "A resort, huh? May have to check it out sometime. I don't mind a good afternoon at the beach.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.leoMoved": "Poor kid. Least he had the parrots, but... Musta been awful hard out there, all alone.$s#$b#Means we'll have to do our best to help him goin' forward.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.adoptionLetter": "I heard you're gonna adopt! Don't let anyone say that kid isn't yours once you've got 'em.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.childArrive": "I'm damn happy for you, you know. It ain't for everyone, but for the people who want a kid, a kid's a real blessing.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.CaughtLegend": "Willy's been goin' on and on about you catchin' a legend. You really made his day.$h",
    //DIALOG FOR MUNICIPAL CTs
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SheriffGuild_Bill": "Been a while since I've seen [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MarlonName] and Gil in person. Good to know they're doin' well.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SheriffWizard_Bill.true": "Good to know the witch is there if somethin' goes weird.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SheriffWizard_Bill.false": "Think I might stop by that wizard's again sometime. Can't hurt to know more about what can go wrong, can it?",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SheriffLinus_Bill": "Be careful on that mountain. Demetrius is havin' some surveys run to check on stability after those landslides.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SheriffMorris_Bill": "Sorry 'bout that earlier. With [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MorrisName]. [CapitalizeFirstLetter [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MorrisFella]]'s real deep in that Joja propaganda.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.BillShane1_Bill": "I wish I could do more for Shane, but it's somethin' he's gotta want for himself.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.BillShane2_Bill": "I couldn't be happier seein' Shane get himself together. Says he's got a hobby project to work on, too. Those can really help.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.Sheriff2H_Bill": "Lewis's ideas'are... traditional. I'm tryin' to find the best way to respond to them.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.Sheriff4H_Bill": "Thanks for listenin' earlier. Didn't mean to bring things down, but havin' someone listen can really help.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.Sheriff6H_Bill": "Elena says hi. I showed her a picture of your farm, and she's rootin' for you to succeed.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.Sheriff8H_Bill": "I've just about finished puttin' together my ideas. I'm gonna present 'em to the whole town.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.Sheriff10H_Bill": "You know, talkin with you really helped me get my ideas together for that presentation. Thanks again.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.BillRivalHearts_Bill": "Heard you gave Ras some advice... Thanks for convincin' him he deserves a chance.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.BillRasDate3_Bill": "Thanks for helpin' Jas with that squirrel. He may a' been alright, but it was sure worth checkin'.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.BillRasDate4_Bill": "I love watchin' it snow. It's just so peaceful.",
    //DIALOGUE FOR MOD CTs
    //Sunberry
    "MV.Municipal.CT.EliasHouseBegin": "Elias is finally movin' out of that storage room? 'Bout time!'$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.ReihanaIntro": "$query PLAYER_HAS_SEEN_EVENT Current 102701#ANOTHER demon summoning?? What's with this valley?$10#$b#Maybe Ras will know what to do...$3|Summoned what now?$10#$b#That's a bit above my pay grade. Maybe Ras will know what to do...$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.ReihanaIntro_memory_oneweek": "Those devil gals haven't caused anybody any trouble, so that's a relief.#$b#The other one's a bit edgy, but Aicha's pleasant enough. Energetic, but pleasant.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SilasWizard": "'Tween me and Silas, you'd think Ras likes hangin' out with oddball curious older fellas.$h",
    //Always Raining in the Valley
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SterlingTrain": "It's... unfortunate, you know. Small towns like this tend to have a big problem with addiction.$5#$b#Don't judge people too much for it. It ain't a moral failing, it's a sickness.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SterlingDrugs": "...$8#$b#You're Sterling's friend, right?$3#$b#...Could you keep an eye on 'im? He avoids me. Suppose I've got an idea why.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SterlingSobriety": "It's a hard thing to do, getting sober. I hope Sterling's ready for a fight.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SterlingRelapse": "Not surprised. This ain't an insult to Sterling, it's just real common to relapse. Deal with it enough and you learn to brace for it.$3#$b#I hope it's just a bump in the road to recovery.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SterlingDinner": "Heard about Shane and Sterling. I know he took it well, but I'm damn worried for Shane.$2#$b#It could push 'im to do better, or it could feel like there's one less person who cares about 'im. Too early to tell.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SterlingRiver": "Sterling actually came up to me himself to talk for once. I think it's a good sign for his future.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.hayforhorses": "I think Sterling and Shane are talkin' again. With both of them clean, maybe they can support each other in a good way this time 'round.$h",
    //East Scarp
    "MV.Municipal.CT.JasperGone2": "$query PLAYER_HAS_SEEN_EVENT Current MadDog.BearFam.16193005#First Gunnar, now Jasper...$3#$b#I wish Jasper hadn't gone off alone. Didn't hear about it until he was gone, or I'd have insisted...$2|I wish Jasper hadn't gone off alone. Didn't hear about it until he was gone, or I'd have insisted...$2",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.JasperHomeA": "$query PLAYER_HAS_SEEN_EVENT Current MadDog.BearFam.16193005#Didn't think I'd be gettin' this much worry from the mines on this beat.$3#$b#But thank Yoba Jasper's home. Not in one piece, but it's sure better than no pieces.$8|Thank Yoba Jasper's home. Not in one piece, but it's sure better than no pieces.$8",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.JulietMomsGossip": "Yeah, Jodi and Caroline've been buggin' me about Juliet too.$8#$b#I think they've just decided I'm lyin' down on the job when I tell 'em to give her a chance. Hope Rosa's talk shook some sense into 'em.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.JulietSmashMelons": "Don't know why [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MorrisName] cares so much 'bout melons that're goin' to waste anyway. Guess it's a Joja thing.$3#$b#In the city they ruin their garbage food on purpose. Don't want it to feed anybody homeless.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.JulietStaying": "I'm glad Juliet's stayin'. Was ready to fight somebody to keep her from bein' sent off...#$b#Don't gimme that look. You think not likin' to fight means I'm bad at it?$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.JulietParents": "Juliet's parents... Ain't never met someone I want to fight on sight like those two.$3#$b#They're just about everything I hate. Obsessed with looks, with bein 'respectable'. But rotten to the core.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.Juliet_TalentShow": "Ha! I like the idea of the talent show, but ain't none of my talents the kind you put on a stage.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.EyvinderTown": "A troll, huh? Well, don't see that matterin' much. Seems like a fine fella to me.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.Kataryna_Visits": "I try not to think the worst of people, but that Kataryna sure knows how to make a bad first impression.$3#$b#Got the kinda attitude that'd make me hesitate to tell 'er the sky's blue. Can't help in her line of work, can it?$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.AbyssRoosterGrow": "That little chicken followin' Kataryna around's an odd one, but he's awful cute.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.AbyssVBear": "I'm glad Abyss is alright. Ain't surprised he did it. Roosters are protective little guys.#$b#I've ordered some bear-proofing so folks can secure their trashcans better, hopefully avoid another bear situation.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.GuntherKatarynaCoverse": "Glad Kataryna's mellowed out a bit. Don't know what her problem was, but she seems to have simmered down.",
    //Lurking in the Dark
    "MV.Municipal.CT.LitD_CT_SenMet": "Keep seein' these kinda person-shaped shadows outta the corner of my eye. Think cop work in the city really got to my nerves.$3",
    //Nora
    "MV.Municipal.CT.NoraSad": "You know Nora better'n I do. Is she alright?$2#$b#My daughter sent me a picture of a pretty lizard she saw on a trip, an' Nora hardly had a reaction.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.NoraBusy": "Glad Nora got out of her rut. Wouldn't want a ray of sunshine like that to go out.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.NoraProud": "A PhD's somethin' to be proud of for sure. And Nora's sure worked hard for it.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.NoraChameleon": "My phone's blowin' up with pictures of that chameleon Nora was lookin' for. Half of 'em, you can't even see it.$h#$b#Guess that's to be expected. It is a chameleon after all...",
    //Rodney O'Brien
    "MV.Municipal.CT.TalkWithGunther": "Didn't realize Rodney O'Brien lived out here. My daughter loves his books. Used to read Arcana Catcher Prunus to her as a kid. %revealtaste:MV.Municipal_SheriffBill:WWWA.Book.ArcanaCatcherPrunus $h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.RodneyPoetryReading": "Just spent too long talking to Rodney about his midnight reading. Some people got things to do in the morning and need sleep.$5",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.FerngillNationalLibraryReading": "You know, I heard Arcana Catcher Prunus was some big disaster.$3#$b#Can't say it was my favorite, but my daughter loved it, so I what did I care? I ain't the target audience.",
    //Metalcore
    "MV.Municipal.CT.CamieOrchidKnife": "The damn chicken's armed. I got a headache big as the moon.$5",
    //Eli and Dylan
    "MV.Municipal.CT.EliIntro": "That Eli's a real ball of energy.$h#$b#I wish he'd stick to roofs that don't have holes in 'em, though...$3#$b#Hm? Oh, climbin' a building ain't against the law. The legal trouble's being trespassed because the building owner's mad at you for climbin' their building.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.DylanBeach": "Don't know what happened yesterday, but you'd think a trash tornado hit.$3#$b#I suspect it was a yacht I saw goin' by. Yoba forbid the rich have to see trash in cans on their fancy yacht.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SootIntro": "Soot's a cute little guy. You really got those mobbin' you in the mines?",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.EliGuestRoom": "I mentioned Eli to Ras an' [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHis] face turned dark as Soot. Asked what he did, and [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHe] gave me the ol 'Pray you never know.'$10#$b#It musta been somethin'. Imagine, Ras not wantin' to explain somethin' magic.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.EliFogHounds": "Glad Marnie's animals are safe. You know, people act like Eli's a quack, but I don't see 'im that way.#$b#I mean, what's the line between 'magic monster' and 'cryptid' anyway, other than fewer people've seen it?",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.DylanExpedition": "That footage was really somethin'! Think I saw a Pourtalesia heptneri on the way down.$h#$b#That's a kind of sea urchin. Looks a bit like a badly shaved hedgehog with no face.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.DylanArticle": "I think Dylan really nailed that interview. Got my own copy of it earlier.$h",
    //Abigail and Juliet Prank the JojaMart
    "MV.Municipal.CT.PTJ03": "I should probably be cross about the crabs at the Jojamart, but I can't find it in me.$h",
    //Bear Family
    "MV.Municipal.CT.BearFamTimeForBees": "Wish people would stop goin' on about Sig bein' grouchy. Fella's been off at war. Ain't a cheery place to be.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.BearFamFireDrill": "By the time the firewatch tower called me, the fire was already out. Reckon I got there right after you left.#$b#Glad nothin' too bad happened.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SigDineAndDash": "Hatin' crowds is pretty common with vets. Hyper-awareness leaves em' expectin' danger from any movement.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SigVersusCrabs": "I aim to talk to [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MarlonName] 'bout that crab situation. Won't do to have people assaulted by crabs on their way home...$5",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SigtheSoldier": "Survivor's guilt is a heck of a thing. Sig don't seem the type to look for help, though.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SigtheHero": "How'd Sig look when you last saw 'im? I'm damn glad y'all found him...$6",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SigSoItBegins": "Glad Sig's finally gettin' the help he needs. Everybody needs help sometimes.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SigTheraBees": "I think Sig'd be a fine teacher. He's got the right temperament for it.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SigandHonors": "We can get Sig another medal for confrontin' his fear of crowds.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.GunnarBuildsaBomb": "I know he didn't INTEND on settin' off a bomb, but...$5#$b#...maybe we oughta find a spot in the deep mountains for Gunnar's potion experiments.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.GunnarBreaksASword": "I feel for Gunnar. Not everybody finds their place right off.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.GunnarGetsaLecture": "He may have his problems like everyone, but Gun didn't deserve that.$3#$b#Really, tryin' to lecture a kid what to do with his life... That's his own choice.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.GunnarMissing": "$query PLAYER_HAS_SEEN_EVENT Current 50709912#First Jasper, now Gunnar...$3#$b#Damn mines. Y'all keep an eye out for him.$8|Ain't Gun supposed to be back by now?$2",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.GunnartheLost": "$query PLAYER_HAS_SEEN_EVENT Current 50709912#Didn't think I'd be gettin' this much worry from the mines on this beat.$3#$b#Harvey says Gun'll be fine at any rate. I sure hope so.$2|Harvey says Gun'll be fine at any rate. I sure hope so.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.GunnarCellarBomb": "In his own basement??$11#$b#Damn it, Gun...$5",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.GunnarTalkofTheTown": "Well, least Lewis got around to the apology eventually. Gun deserved it.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SondraAerobicsAttempt": "I aim to stop by Sondra's after my rounds. Maybe distract her with some old albums I dug up.$3#$b#What? Ain't just her that likes that kind a' music.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SondraFundraiser": "A battle of bands? Sounds like a great idea. I'm sure Sondra knows what she's doin' with it.#$b#She's one organized lady. Guess you have to be in her line of work.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.ASongforSondra": "All the bands did great, but our kids did the best of all of 'em. I might be biased, though.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.GudrunAgainsttheMachine": "'Disturbing the peace'?$10#$b#Is Lewis just gonna say that about any protest? Nobody was blockin' the door or anything.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.GudrunCollegeFears": "Deciding your kid's major for 'em is a great way to make 'em burn out hard. If they stick around long enough to study, that is.$3#$b#Good way to lose your kid, too.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.GudrunRunAway": "Maybe a bit of time away'll set both sides to rights. Gudrun'll be back when she's ready.$3#$b#Me? I ain't seen her anywhere. Not even at Haley's.$7",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.GudrunComesHome": "Gudrun's home safe and sound. Knew it'd work out alright. Now everyone can talk things out.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.JojaAccusations": "I've already given Gudrun a packet on legal threats from corporations. Sondra's got all that under control anyways, I'm sure.#$b#But this is for you: Don't you say a damn thing to Joja. Even if you think it'll help Gudrun.$3#$b#The threat may even be just that, a scare tactic. Don't give 'em anything to work with.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.GudrunCollegeIdeas": "[LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:PierreName] ain't wrong. Gudrun'd be a hell of a lawyer. She's got some good options for her future.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.GudrunVJoja": "Ha! Saw that Joja suit hightail it outta here like someone'd lit his tail on fire. Gudrun really had 'im on the run.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.MeetSassy": "Sassy may a' failed outta service dog school, but that don't make her a bad dog.$h#$b#Dogs like that gotta have someplace to live. May as well be here.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.TerenSelfEsteem": "Teren's got the best brownies I ever had. No hard, dry bits from the edge of the pan or anything.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.TerenCaritasBakery": "A bakery's a great idea. And I ain't just sayin' that because I want some more of those brownies.$h",
    //Woodsman Hurst
    "MV.Municipal.CT.HurstBackstoryDrop": "That shy fella who doesn't talk to much anybody seemed awful upset the last time I saw 'im.$3#$b#You seem to get on with 'im better than most, is he alright?$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.HurstStopsObeying": "Met Hurst earlier. Finally know his name at least. Glad he's gettin' out and meetin' people now.#$b#Fella seems awful sheltered in all kinds a' ways, but he's friendly enough now that he ain't avoidin' everyone.",
    //Sword and Sorcery
    "MV.Municipal.CT.MateoAcceptance": "Glad things are sorted out with Mateo. They seem like a good kid.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.HectorHeal": "Ran into Hector helpin' out Jacob. Really got a way with animals like I ain't seen before.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.CirrusArrives": "I know Cirrus don't want a fuss kicked up over her, but I am keepin' an eye out for crazy fan types.#$b#Can't be too careful. Fandom makes some people lose their heads.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.DandelionSettling": "I suppose opposites do attract sometimes. Dandelion and Rosalin are a real matched set.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.WyattReturns": "Wyatt comin' back is a bit of a legal tangle, but Lewis and Gunther and him've worked somethin' out.",
    //Ridgeside
    "MV.Municipal.CT.Naomi_Return": "Met Shiro and Yuuma's mom earlier! Musta been hard to be away from her kids when one of em's sick. Bet she's glad to be back.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.RSV_Ariah8Hearts": "Finally properly met that Amethyne girl, Ariah. Sounds like she was burnin' her candle at both ends.#$b#Some parents are liable to work their kids to death in school, forget they need a break. Glad she had a friend like you to help her out.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.RSV_Maive8Hearts": "Matron Amethyne invited me to one of those fancy parties they have. Wanted to introduce me to some police expert.$3#$b#I know the guy's work. Had to sit through a class of his. Big fad back in the city for his style. Man has blood on his hands.$3#$b#Oh, I kept my refusal civil. Gave her some readin' material on the topic. Maybe she'll even read it.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.RSV_Bryle2Hearts": "That fella who protects the Governor came by earlier. Askin' bout some kind of assassinations.$3#$b#Way outta my pay grade. And anyone can put on a scarf. He didn't seem surprised, anyway. Least he understood my position.",
    //Quinn
    "MV.Municipal.CT.QuinnIntro": "Just met Quinn and... hooboy.$8#$b#I don't know, do they do interventions for corporate brainwashing? There a patch or a support group for that?$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.QuinnInBed": "I wish Quinn wasn't so deep in the Joja rabbithole... That job's killin' her.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.QuinnBetter": "Quinn's been lookin' a lot better lately. Glad she's recoverin'.$h",
    //Jean and Jorts
    "MV.Municipal.CT.MeetTheCats": "Guess talkin' cats ain't that different from regular cats.#$b#The union work's a plus, though.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.OpenAllTheDoors": "Course Joja'd rather close down than treat their people right. They don't give a damn.#$b#Hate that everyone lost their jobs, though. Maybe the town can dig up somethin' for 'em.$3",
    //Kent Gets Therapy
    "MV.Municipal.CT.KentTherapy": "I'm glad Kent's getting the help he needs. It's a hard thing, coming back from a battlefield.",
    //Rekindle
    "MV.Municipal.CT.Rekindle_JobOffer": "It's good that Kent's got somethin' to keep his hands busy. Easy to sink into bad thoughts if you got too much idle time.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.Rekindle_CampingTrip": "Don't think [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:PierreGenderHe] hated it as much as [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:PierreGenderHe] claims, but still. [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:PierreName] looked like a wet cat comin' in from that trip.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.Rekindle_JodiKentAway": "I'm sure Sam'll do fine lookin' after Vincent. Every couple needs some time to themselves when they can get it.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.Rekindle_JigsawPuzzle": "Jodi's got some awful pretty puzzles she's workin' on.$h#$b#I tried those for stress once, but I do 'em too fast.",
    //Lucikiel
    "MV.Municipal.CT.LucikielArrives": "You know, there ain't a law against summoning a demon. Don't think anybody thought that was somethin' we needed a law against.$5#$b#Least the demon seems alright. He's got sense enough to not work for Joja, and he ain't hurtin' anybody.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.ReputationIncreased": "Well, all's well that ends well. [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MorrisName] never figured [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MorrisGenderHis] little summon would end up being a fine addition to the town, did [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MorrisGenderHe]?$h",
    //Ranger Taro
    "MV.Municipal.CT.RangerFirstMet": "Don't know why they're sendin' out a forest ranger when it ain't a national forest, but I guess they got their reasons.#$b#Doesn't hurt to have someone keepin' an eye on conservation 'round here.$h",
    //Sebastian's Frog Sanctuary
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SebFrogLake": "It's nice to see kids so set on doin' the world some good. And the world wouldn't be as nice without frogs.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SebFrogVideo": "Haley might be embarrassed, but a funny clip like that could really get some eyes on the project who might not have looked otherwise.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SebFrogSick": "Of all things, I saw Sebastian and Demetrius hangin' out earlier. Looked downright friendly! Glad for it.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SebFrogFrog": "Sorry, there's a frog HOW big out there?$10",
    //Alchemistry
    "MV.Municipal.CT.AlchemistryPotionQuest": "Heard you helped out with medicine for Harvey. Guess you can add 'healer' to your resume now, too.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.AlchemistryPotionQuest2": "[LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MarlonName] says you're helpin' the guild with potions, too. You got a lot of talents, you know that?$h",
    //Morris Redeemed
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SiMorrisCC": "[LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MorrisName] is back, huh? Suppose I ain't surprised they let [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MorrisGenderHim] go. Joja throws out their people like trash.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SiMorrisFriendly": "Think [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MorrisName]'s finally loosened up a bit. Good to see [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MorrisGenderHim] doin' well instead of burning [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MorrisGenderHimself] out for a corporation.$h",
    //Downhill Project
    "MV.Municipal.CT.DH.Inauguration_Church": "The church's rebuilt at last! Took 'em long enough to care about it, but better late than never.",
    //Niki
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SVTNikiandSam": "Was worried the reporter'd be a muckraker, but she seems like a decent sort. Asks good questions.#$b#Heh, don't know what muck there'd be to rake on a farm other than the kind the cows leave anyway.$h",
    //Adventurer Abigail
    "MV.Municipal.CT.AdvAbiFirstMine": "Saw Abigail in the guild earlier. Think I surprised [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:AbiHer] by bein' there.#$b#Nah, I ain't gonna snitch. I'm proud [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:AbiShes] aimin' to do what she wants, even if [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:AbiHer] parents ain't on board.#$b#[LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:AbiShe] mentioned you'd brought [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:AbiHer] there, so I know tellin' you's safe.$7",
    //Daulton and Maple
    "MV.Municipal.CT.Maple": "That rabbit of Daulton's is a cute little menace. Don't leave anything out where it can get chewed.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.Daulton": "Daulton ain't alone, I ain't any good on a boat either. Managed to fall out of a kayak at camp when I was younger.",
    //Simple Penny Expanded
    "MV.Municipal.CT.PamPennySaloon": "I get why someone might blame a saloon for enablin' an alcoholic, but it ain't really the case.$3#$b#You ban alcohol, and people make their own. Maybe poison themselves doin' it wrong. It ain't addressin' the core problem.$3#$b#And you can't fix someone else. They gotta try to get better themselves or they just fall straight back in.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.PamHealth": "$query LOCATION_ACCESSIBLE Desert#I sure hope that scare gets Pam on a better path. Hate to see her keep slidin' downhill.$3#$b#I'm sure havin' her job back helps at least. People gotta need to feel useful, at least a little bit.|I sure hope that scare gets Pam on a better path. Hate to see her keep slidin' downhill.$3#$b#Wish she could get a job she likes, that'd sure help. People gotta need to feel useful, at least a little bit.$3",
    //Casper
    "MV.Municipal.CT.CasperNameDrop": "Casper got my name right the first try. While flirting.#$b#Can't say I'm interested. Bit young, for one.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.CasperTheThief": "Lots of homeless folks steal because they ain't got a better option. Don't know how much of it's that for Casper.$3#$b#Nobody's reported 'em for any kind a' restitution yet, but if you'd like to, we'll work somethin' out with community service.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.CasperMockApology": "It can be hard to try to do better when you feel like you got nothin'.$3#$b#Ain't excusing Casper's behavior, but it's somethin' to keep in mind.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.CasperRealApology": "Glad Casper's doin' better. I'd hate to see anybody fail, 'specially surrounded by people who care about 'em.",
    //Fleurine
    "MV.Municipal.CT.FleurineIntro": "I escaped a makeover with Fleurine by sayin' I need to be in uniform. And with no other cop in town, I'm always on the clock.#$b#But to her credit, she took that explanation just fine. Truth be told, I never could be bothered with fashion.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.TouchofClass": "I think there's a few things this town could use before 'sophistication', if I'm honest.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.FleurineGlimmeringMoments": "Mm. Never met anyone who felt the need to perform as hard as Fleurine who wasn't compensatin' for some kinda pressure.$3#$b#That was me for a little while. Tried too hard to be a man in the ways everyone thought I should be. Made me miserable.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.GoodDeeds": "Fleurine seems a bit more relaxed lately. Still her, of course, but more natural about it.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.FleurineRefinesWizard": "I don't think Ras needs any refining. [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHis] look has its own charm.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.PastelWizard": "Heh, Fleurine tried to get me on her side to talk Ras into wearin' pastels.$3#$b#'Fraid I'm not a fan of pushin' people to look one way or another, so she's on 'er own with that one.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.FleuRasAnnualReview": "It's funny to hear somethin' like magic's tied up in bureaucratic red tape, too. Damn paperwork gets in everywhere.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.eventSeen_FleuRas02": "It might seem like Ras doesn't like Fleurine, but at worst, [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHe]'s a bit sore 'bout her bein' sent as oversight.#$b#That's how [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHe] grouses at someone [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHe] likes. Given time, [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHe] might even admit it.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.eventSeen_FleuRas05": "I told Ras if the Institute had a problem with [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHim], they were blind.#$b#Guess they can see fine after all, since [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHe]'s back without issue.$h",
    //Adventurer's Guild Expanded
    "MV.Municipal.CT.GabrielArrive": "I heard Gabe and Zinnia were gonna be movin' into town. Good to see 'em again.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SillyRevealed": "I got no problem with Silly. Don't see why anyone'd have problem with a friendly little fella like that.",
    "MV.Municipal.CT.GabeFinished": "I imagine you and the other guild members'll have a safer time if you found a way to protect people from slimes.",
    //Birthday Conversation Topic and Game State Query
    "MV.Municipal.CT.PlayerBirthday": "Happy birthday! Thought you might like somethin' new to read. [SkillBook_0 SkillBook_1 SkillBook_2 SkillBook_3 SkillBook_4]$h",
    //Failed Quests Lose Friendship
    "MV.Municipal.CT.QuestFailed": "Forget somethin? Don't burn yourself out acceptin' more requests than you can finish, now.",
    //DIALOG FOR ADDED MOD CTs
    //Lurking in the Dark
    "MV.Municipal.CT.KrobusSen": "Krobus says there's another one of those shadow fellas out there who's less of a homebody.#$b#Guess I know who I kept seein' in the corner of my eye. Maybe he'll say hi one day.",
    //Little Red Schoolhouse
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SchoolRepaired": "I heard you got the old schoolhouse repaired!$h#$b#Real good of you. Hard enough teachin' kids without distractions all round 'em.",
    //Alchemistry
    "MV.Municipal.CT.AlchemistryStabilizer": "Ras says you're 'more than adequate' as a potion-brewer. Big praise from [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHim].$h",
    //Ranger Taro
    "MV.Municipal.CT.RangerMentionSmuggler": "A smuggler? Huh. She ain't said a thing to me about it.$10",
    //East Scarp
    "MV.Municipal.CT.SheriffJuliet": "You be good to Juliet, you hear? Everyone deserves a second chance, no matter what they did.#$b#What did she do? That ain't my place to say.$3",
    //The Promise of Choice
    "MV.Municipal.CT.AliyahFamily": "Aliyah came round earlier. Told 'er I didn't need her services, but it was kind to ask.#$b#The force may not have been good for much, but they had a good therapist. Helped a lot when Menawa passed.",
    //Tall Ladies
    "MV.Municipal.CT.TallLadies": "They sure grow ladies tall 'round here, don't they? Somethin' in the water, you think?",
    //NPC CTs
    "MV.NewSheriff_Pierre": "[LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MorrisName] hasn't been back in my store since Sheriff Bill gave [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MorrisGenderHim] that ticket. And good riddance!$1",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Lewis": "Have you said hello to the new sheriff yet? [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MarlonName] told me Bill's the most principled man [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MarlonGenderHe] knows.$1",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Marlon": "I've known Bill for years. He's a good man. He'll treat this town right.",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Elliott": "I met Sheriff Bill at the library earlier! Gunther didn't have the novel that I was looking for, but Bill let me borrow his copy.$3",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Willy": "The sheriff's an angler! He came by earlier to talk about the fishing 'round here.#$b#I think we'll get along just fine.$1",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Wizard": "A sheriff? I wasn't aware that the town lacked law enforcement.",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Gunther": "I think Sheriff Bill unloaded more books than furniture into that apartment. A man after my own heart, it seems.",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Haley": "I thought they were sending a sheriff from Zuzu.$7#$b#I mean, have you heard his accent? He's more country than most people here.$3",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Emily": "I met the new sheriff earlier! He has a really soothing, positive energy.",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Sam.true": "I guess I'll get to know the new sheriff well. I still have some community service from the mayor...$2",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Sam.false": "I guess I'll get to know the new sheriff well. I still have some community service from the mayor...$2#$b#You don't think it'll go on my permanent record now, do you?$8",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Abigail.true": "Sam's worried the new cop might hassle him over his community service.$2",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Abigail.false": "I had to tell Sam that a 'permanent record' for informal community service isn't really a thing. He was super worried.$2",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Sebastian": "I don't really care about the new sheriff. It's not like anything happens here anyway.",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Alex": "That sheriff looks pretty fit. You think the police have a special workout or something?",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Vincent": "I wanna be a sheriff when I grow up! Mom says they keep us safe from bad guys!$1",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Jas": "Sheriff Bill seems nice. He got a blue jay feather for me! Isn't it pretty? It was stuck on that tree where I couldn't reach.$1",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Leah": "...There were a lot of bad things about the police back home. I'm not sure about bringing a Zuzu cop here.$2",
    "MV.NewSheriff_George": "About damn time this place had some municipal services! I've had to go all the way to Zuzu for too long for too much.#$b#Especially with the bus down!$3",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Evelyn": "I think I'll bring some cookies as a welcome gift to Mr. Bill and Ms. Alicia.",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Jodi": "I feel better knowing that we've got an officer here now. We haven't had any problems with crime, but I'm glad he's here, just in case.",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Caroline": "I'm glad they've finished that municipal building. The construction noise really cut into my tea time.",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Maru": "Did you see the tank? Oh, the sheriff, he has a tank of the cutest sea urchins!$1#$b#And the coral looked really healthy, too!",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Linus": "Police officers and people without houses... they don't mix well.$2",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Harvey": "I felt rude asking, but... the sheriff was really nice when I asked him about their radios.#$b#He said their frequencies shouldn't interfere with my ham radio set.$1",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Clint": "I've never been robbed or anything, but I guess it's good to get a sheriff before anything like that happens. Right?",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Gus": "You know I'm always happy to see a new face in town! Though I'll have to remember, he's not a beer man. He turned one down earlier. %revealtaste:MV.Municipal_SheriffBill:346",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Marnie": "Lewis is really excited about the new sheriff. I haven't met him yet, but I trust [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MarlonName]'s word that he's a good man.",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Shane": "Yeah, I heard there's a sheriff now. What about it?$2",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Penny": "I wonder if I could get Sheriff Bill to give a little speech for the class one day. They're a bit young for a talk about drugs, but... hmm.",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Pam": "Yeah, a cop. Just one more thing for me to worry about.$2#$b#I ain't done anything wrong! I just don't get along with cops.$3",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Robin": "So, what do you think of the Municipal Building? It took work, but I think it came together well enough.",
    "MV.NewSheriff_Demetrius": "Robin's pleased to be done with the Municipal Building. She can put more creativity and artistry into private buildings.",
    "MV.SheriffGuild_Marlon": "Good to see Bill again. It's been too long since we've met up in person.",
    "MV.SheriffWizard_Wizard": "It is good to know that your law enforcement is willing to consider more than the mundane.$h",
    "MV.SheriffSam_Sam": "Turns out the sheriff's actually pretty cool.$h",
    "MV.SheriffSam_Abigail": "I'm glad Sam's not afraid of the sheriff anymore. He was getting really paranoid...",
    "MV.SheriffLinus_Demetrius": "I hope the mountainside's stability hasn't been too badly affected by those landslides...$2#$b#We will know for certain after running some surveys.",
    "MV.SheriffLinus_Linus": "I met the sheriff earlier. I hope he is truly as helpful as he seems now.",
    "MV.SebRocks_Linus": "The [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:SebBoy] who lives near me came over to apologize today. [CapitalizeFirstLetter [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:SebHe]] was accidentally knocking rocks onto my tent.#$b#It was good of [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:SebHim] to apologize, even though it was an accident.$h",
    "MV.SheriffKrobus_Krobus": "Bill seems nice! I hope he likes his windchime.$h",
    "MV.SheriffKrobus_George": "It was good of Bill to drop everything and go down a sewer for an old man. Good thing there wasn't anything wrong down there.$h",
    "MV.SheriffShane1_Shane": "Hey, uh... Sorry about last night. I was having a bad night.$3",
    "MV.SheriffPam_Pam": "Bill's been trying to get me into ginger beers. He orders some in from the city for himself, and he's been sharing his stash.",
    "MV.SheriffSandy_Sandy": "Your new sheriff stopped by earlier! He came all this way just to see if I need anything.",
    "MV.KentHome_Kent": "I was so worried about everyone while I was gone. With a sheriff around, maybe I can worry less.",
    "MV.Sheriff2H_Lewis": "I'm excited for the sheriff to look over my ideas. I think they'll really be good for this town.$h",
    "MV.Sheriff4H_Lewis": "It seems like every time I see the sheriff, he's not doing anything.$3",
    "MV.Sheriff4H_Willy": "Lewis can be a bit of a busybody sometimes. He ought to give Bill a chance.",
    "MV.Sheriff4H_Pierre": "I think Bill's doing fine! [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MorrisName] hasn't harassed my business once since he gave [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MorrisGenderHim] that ticket.$1",
    "MV.Sheriff4H_Caroline": "The new sheriff is certainly... low-key, isn't he? I expected someone more authoritative.$2",
    "MV.Sheriff4H_Leah": "I tried to raise some concerns to the sheriff about the history of policing, but he knew as much about it as I do. We had a great conversation.$h",
    "MV.Sheriff4H_Vincent": "Sheriff Bill says that sheriffs do a lot of paperwork. I wanna be a firefighter instead!$1",
    "MV.Sheriff8H_Lewis": "I'm just about out of patience with Bill. He hasn't implemented anything I asked about.$3",
    "MV.Sheriff8H_Gunther": "Bill ordered some books and donated them straight to the library. Elliott and Leah already checked some of them out.",
    "MV.Sheriff10H_Pierre": "Caroline was worried, but I always knew Bill had a good head on his shoulders.$1",
    "MV.Sheriff10H_Lewis": "I underestimated Bill. It was smart to listen to what the whole community really wanted before acting.",
    "MV.Sheriff10H_Marlon": "Glad that's all settled. Bill's been giving himself an ulcer worrying.",
    "MV.Sheriff10H_Gunther": "Now I know what those special books Bill wanted were for. Always happy to help spread knowledge.",
    "MV.Sheriff10H_Haley": "Evelyn's going to teach Emily and me how to quilt. We can use old fabric to make something cute and useful!$h",
    "MV.Sheriff10H_Emily": "Restoring the world is always more positive than destruction. I'm glad people can see that.",
    "MV.Sheriff10H_Alex": "I'm gonna volunteer to help clear out brush after storms and green rain. That stuff really gets in my granddad's way.",
    "MV.Sheriff10H_George": "Good to see you kids learning from history and doing something about it.",
    "MV.Sheriff10H_Elliott": "Those books Bill loaned me were really fascinating. Sad, but fascinating. I can only hope we do better.",
    "MV.Sheriff10H_Evelyn": "It will be nice to have some charity work to support close to home.",
    "MV.Sheriff10H_Jodi": "Maybe someone will be able to use the clothes Vincent has grown out of.$h",
    "MV.Sheriff10H_Caroline": "[LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:PierreName] was right about Bill. It's hard to think how trying to keep our families safe can actually do harm if you do it wrong.",
    "MV.Sheriff10H_Maru": "I've got some great ideas for environmentally-friendly refrigeration for the pantry!",
    "MV.Sheriff10H_Linus": "The free pantry actually sounds nice. I can give what I find and take out a bit of variety.",
    "MV.Sheriff10H_Harvey": "I'm getting together some resources from Zuzu for health services we can't support locally.$1",
    "MV.Sheriff10H_Gus": "I love the idea of a place where people can get the food they need without judgment.$h",
    "MV.Sheriff10H_Penny": "I understand why Bill was reluctant to talk to my students now.#$b#It's too bad that even children have reason to fear the people who are supposed to protect them.$s",
    "MV.Sheriff10H_Pam": "I'm volunteering to make sure people get to their medical appointments in the city. It feels nice to give back.$h",
    "MV.Sheriff10H_Robin": "I'm so excited! I don't get to do projects with my daughter very often.$h",
    "MV.Sheriff10H_Demetrius": "I might get some use out of my hazmat suit during cleanup days. Joja left behind industrial levels of waste.",
    "MV.Sheriff10H_Wizard": "I just attended the meeting for moral support. I assured Bill that his ideas were well-reasoned, but he was worried all the same.",
    "MV.BillRivalHearts_Wizard": "I decided to heed your advice. Bill and I...#$b#We are going to see what the future brings us.$4",
    "MV.BillRivalHearts_Willy": "Bill seems happy with that odd feller from the tower.$h",
    "MV.BillRivalHearts_Marlon": "Didn't expect Bill to hit it off with the wizard like he did. But I'm happy for him.",
    "MV.BillRivalHearts_Elliott": "I don't believe I've seen the fellow that Bill's seeing outside of Spirit's Eve before they got together.#$b#Bill has a way with making friends.$h",
    "MV.BillRasDate1_Wizard": "I rarely think of my childhood these days. It was quite some time ago.",
    "MV.BillRasDate2_Wizard": "Good day. Is something amiss?#$b#...My plants? What about my plants?",
    "MV.BillRasDate3_Wizard": "Really, I thought I looked more 'mysterious' than 'scary.'",
    "MV.BillRasDate3_Jas": "I saw that squirrel again! He was burying nuts for the winter!",
    //EVENT DIALOGUE
    //CC Event Change
    "MV.Municipal.CC.Edit": "Here. You can have my spare key. I'd appreciate if you could help figure out how those kids got in here.#$b#A building in bad shape like this can be dangerous!$3",
    //Vanilla Event Additions
    "MV.Municipal.Cakewalk": "A fine thing to do!",
    //Intro Event
    "MV.Municipal.Intro.01": "Ah, 'scuse me a second, [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MorrisSir]. I haven't met this good citizen yet, and I'm makin' it a point to meet everyone in town.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Intro.02": "Of course, perfectly understandable!$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Intro.03": "Howdy there. You're the other new face in town, right? I'm Bill Stewart, the new sheriff.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Intro.04": "I'll be busy gettin' settled in today, but startin' tomorrow,  just know that if you need anything, you just stop by my office and have a word.#$b#And if you just want to chat, I'm open to that too. If I'm not there, Alicia at the Municipal Building has a radio line to me. You have a nice day, now!$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Intro.05": "...Anyway, [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MorrisMr]. [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MorrisName]-",
    "MV.Municipal.Intro.06": "Just [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MorrisName] is fine, sir. And I'm always happy to help out agents of law and order.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Intro.07": "[LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MorrisName], then.$u#$b#I'm surprised to see the Jojamart manager in a local place.$0",
    "MV.Municipal.Intro.08": "Oh, I wasn't patronizing the place, of course. I was handing out Jojamart's new coupons!$h#$b#You may be surprised at how much you can save over [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:PierreName]'s with a Joja membership!$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Intro.09": "You don't say? And ol' [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:PierreName]'s fine with you handin' them out in [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:PierreGenderHis] store?",
    "MV.Municipal.Intro.10": "Of course not! I'm sure [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:PierreGenderHe] was unhappy to see his customers taking their coupons and leaving.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Intro.11": "...What are you writing?$u",
    "MV.Municipal.Intro.12": "Commercial solicitin' in a business requires permission from the property owner.#$b#Since you're so keen on law and order, I don't suppose you'll mind this ticket?$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Intro.13.false": "WHAT?$2",
    "MV.Municipal.Intro.13.true": "WHAT?$6",
    //Guild Intro Event
    "MV.Municipal.GuildIntro.01": "I really can't thank y'all enough for puttin' in a good word for me with Lewis.",
    "MV.Municipal.GuildIntro.02.true": "We didn't say anything that wasn't true.$2#$b#And you needed to get out of that place before you got killed.",
    "MV.Municipal.GuildIntro.02.false": "We didn't say anything that wasn't true.$h#$b#And you needed to get out of that place before you got killed.",
    "MV.Municipal.GuildIntro.03": "I appreciate it all the same. And it's good to know I've got someone reliable to send anything outside of the ordinary to.",
    "MV.Municipal.GuildIntro.04": "You should stop by the [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasJob] as well, if you haven't yet.",
    "MV.Municipal.GuildIntro.05": "The what?$10",
    "MV.Municipal.GuildIntro.06": "The [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasJob]. Lives in the tower out in Cindersnap, far end. Can't miss it.#$b#We can take care of monsters, of course, but if it's something just weird, [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHe]'d be the one to go to.",
    "MV.Municipal.GuildIntro.07": "Huh. Nobody in town mentioned 'em. Didn't know anybody even lived out there.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.GuildIntro.08": "[CapitalizeFirstLetter [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHe]]'s a reclusive one, but not a bad sort. [CapitalizeFirstLetter [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHe]]'s helped us out in the past.",
    "MV.Municipal.GuildIntro.09": "Howdy there, @. Got business with the guild?$h",
    "MV.Municipal.GuildIntro.10.true": "@'s our newest member! And a promising one at that.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.GuildIntro.10.false": "@'s our newest member! And a promising one at that.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.GuildIntro.11": "You don't say? Guess all that farmin' is good for the sword-arm, too.#$b#Well, y'all be careful, though I'm sure you're in good hands with these two. Got some more paperwork to do before I can settle in. Be seein' ya.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.GuildIntro.12": "You too, Bill.",
    "MV.Municipal.GuildIntro.13": "Oh, Bill's an old friend. We met through his daughter's mom.",
    "MV.Municipal.GuildIntro.14": "It's... complicated.",
    "MV.Municipal.GuildIntro.15": "%Before he can elaborate, Gil falls right back asleep.",
    "MV.Municipal.GuildIntro.16": "...So, what brings you up here?",
    //Ras Intro Event
    "MV.Municipal.RasIntro.01": "And how are you progressing with the junimos?#$b#Ah- don't answer.",
    "MV.Municipal.RasIntro.02": "...Sorry, am I interruptin' somethin?",
    "MV.Municipal.RasIntro.03": "Nothing that can't be continued later. You must be the new 'sheriff'.",
    "MV.Municipal.RasIntro.04": "That's right. Sheriff Bill Stewart, at your service. You can just call me Bill.",
    "MV.Municipal.RasIntro.05": "And I am [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasName]... Seeker of the arcane truths.#$b#Mediary between physical and ethereal.#$b#Master of the seven elementals.#$b#Keeper of the sacred cha-",
    "MV.Municipal.RasIntro.06": "...$9",
    "MV.Municipal.RasIntro.07.true": "...you get the point.",
    "MV.Municipal.RasIntro.07.false": "...you get the point.$l",
    "MV.Municipal.RasIntro.08": "Reckon I do.$h#$b#I'm just here to introduce myself. You let me know if anybody causes you any trouble.#$b#I'd rather avoid another bog witch incident.$8",
    "MV.Municipal.RasIntro.09": "Old case I heard about. Some locals got angry, bog witch turned 'em into toads. Took ages to fix.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.RasIntro.10": "There is no danger of that. The local people give me no trouble, and I have no desire to harm them.",
    "MV.Municipal.RasIntro.11": "%You're not sure anybody in town even knows the [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasJob] actually knows magic. Or that [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHe] even exists, for that matter.",
    "MV.Municipal.RasIntro.12": "Good, good. Some kinds of people have a hard time not hasslin' anyone unusual. Good to know it ain't a problem here.$h#$b#Well, it's a pleasure to meet you, but I better get on. Let you get back to your business.",
    "MV.Municipal.RasIntro.13": "If you ever run into any trouble of a mystical nature, please bring it to my attention. I am more than happy to unravel arcane mysteries.",
    "MV.Municipal.RasIntro.14": "Will do.",
    "MV.Municipal.RasIntro.15.false": "...Huh. He's pretty cute.$4",
    "MV.Municipal.RasIntro.15.true": "...Wonder what the farmer's doin' here.",
    //Morris Followup Event
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.01": "You're really hittin' the coffee today.",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.02": "Oh, I've been helping my brother with the kids. He's gone back to college-",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.03": "What's the meaning of all of this??$3",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.04": "...Howdy to you too, [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MorrisName]. 'Scuse us, Alicia.$10",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.05": "Of course, Bill. Just a bit longer, farmer, the system's acting up...",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.06": "Don't you 'howdy' me! Why are you targeting me with these tickets?$3",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.07": "...Targeting you? I'm just doin' my job. Those're ordinance tickets.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.08": "And paying them is coming out of my budget!$3",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.09": "Well... alright, maybe don't break the ordinances?$3",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.10": "I'm just following my- Look, these aren't important things. I mean, Mr. [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MullnerName] can get into the door with help even with that step-$3",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.11": "I think they're pretty important. And if you'd followed the rules, you wouldn't have to fix a thing.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.12": "But the facade is standardized for small towns! I can't just alter it. This business is doing so much for the town, can't you cut me a break?$3",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.13": "My home town cut you folks a break when I was younger and y'all moved in. Know how that went?$3",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.14.false": "...How?$3",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.14.true": "...How?$2",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.15": "After the local competition shut down, the prices went up. They cut staff to cut costs, cuttin' out jobs. Still didn't keep their numbers goin' up enough.$3#$b#So they shut it down. Left it to rot. People had to get food a town over, and that wasn't close by.$8",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.16.false": "...$3",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.16.true": "...$2",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.17": "...Look. You're actin' like I'm doing this to you. I'm not. You know who's doin' this to you?$3",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.18": "Please, you're the one who-$3",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.19": "Your boss. Your boss is the one givin' the orders you're just followin', right?$3#$b#Bet you didn't even know 'bout half of these ordinances. Your job's managin' people. But they damn well should.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.20.false": "That's not fair, they're... busy.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.20.true": "That's not fair, they're... busy.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.21": "Is it fair that you gotta pay for it?$3",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.22.false": "...$3",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.22.true": "...$2",
    "MV.Municipal.MorrisFollowup.23": "Just think about that a bit.$3",
    //Sam and Lewis Followup Event
    "MV.Municipal.SamLewis.01": "...!$8",
    "MV.Municipal.SamLewis.02": "Howdy there, Sam! Mind if I have a word?$h",
    "MV.Municipal.SamLewis.03": "...Yes sir. I mean, no sir, I don't mind.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.SamLewis.04": "Don't gotta be so formal with it. I'm just-",
    "MV.Municipal.SamLewis.05": "This is about the skateboarding thing, right? I'm really sorry. I totally didn't want to damage anything!$2",
    "MV.Municipal.SamLewis.06": "...$11#$b#Well, this is about that, but I'm not here to scold you or anything like that.$h#$b#Look, it ain't fair to say not to skate. Not your fault you live somewhere without a place for it.$0",
    "MV.Municipal.SamLewis.07": "Yeah... But what can I do about it?$7",
    "MV.Municipal.SamLewis.08": "Well, my daughter skateboards. Sometimes she'd go on trips with her mom and not have anyplace to practice.#$b#So she got a portable grind rail.",
    "MV.Municipal.SamLewis.09": "...They make those?",
    "MV.Municipal.SamLewis.10": "Sure do! You can put it in a closet and take it out whenever you skate. And you can pick when and where you wanna use it...$h#$b#So you don't run over any stray mayors.$7",
    "MV.Municipal.SamLewis.11": "That sounds awesome!$h#$b#So your daughter skates?",
    "MV.Municipal.SamLewis.12": "Oh yeah! She's got this fancy maple double-kick she won in a contest back in Zuzu....$h",
    //Linus Event
    "MV.Municipal.BillLinus.01": "Howdy there!$h",
    "MV.Municipal.BillLinus.02": "...Hello. Sir. If- if this is about the trash cans, I promise I'll stop.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.BillLinus.03": "...$2#$b#I'm sorry to scare ya. I've seen what cops back home did to tent cities and the like. I ain't here to cause you any trouble. Mind if I ask your name?$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillLinus.04": "...Linus, sir.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.BillLinus.05": "Well, Linus, long as the trash cans're in public and the trash ain't gettin' everywhere, I ain't letting anyone starve just to protect things people throw out.$h#$b#Really, I'm just here to introduce myself. I'm Bill. You don't got to call me sir or anything.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillLinus.06": "...Okay, Mr. Bill.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillLinus.07": "I'll leave you be. I just want you to know...#$b#If anybody gives you any trouble, you can let me know about it, and I'll do my damnedest to make sure it doesn't happen again.#$b#You're part of this community, even livin' out here, and I aim to protect this community.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillLinus.08": "...$3#$b#Well- wait.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillLinus.09": "Sometimes...#$b#Sometimes people mess with my tent. Usually it's the festivals... tourists. But I've been getting some rocks falling on me out of season...$2",
    "MV.Municipal.BillLinus.10": "So it could be someone throwin' things, or it could be somethin' to do with those landslides.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillLinus.11": "Right. I'd check farther up the mountain, but those landslides have made things difficult. And I'm not getting any younger.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillLinus.12": "I know the feelin'!$h#$b#Tell you what, I'll have a talk with Demetrius, the local scientist. He might have some ideas about how to figure out if it's the landslides and how to shore things up if it is.#$b#I'll ask [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MarlonName] to keep an eye out for anyone throwin' things since [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MarlonGenderHe]'s already got a lookout on the monsters.#$b#And I'll make it a point to check on your tent in festivals to ward off any drunken out of town miscreants. That sound good?",
    "MV.Municipal.BillLinus.13": "I would appreciate that.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillLinus.14": "Well it's a plan, then! I'll get right on it.$h",
    //Sebastian Event, followup to Linus event
    "MV.Municipal.BillSeb.01": "Mind if I join you for a spell?$h",
    "MV.Municipal.BillSeb.02": "...Have I done something wrong?$2",
    "MV.Municipal.BillSeb.03": "Not on purpose. You ain't in trouble, just want to have a word.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillSeb.04": "...alright.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillSeb.05": "Saw somethin' you posted on the help board. Wanted a melon to throw at the mountain?",
    "MV.Municipal.BillSeb.06": "Yeah.#$b#I go up pretty far so nobody's around and just... cut loose.#$b#It doesn't hurt anybody... just blowing off steam.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillSeb.07": "Well... about that.$3#$b#Demetrius has been doin' some surveys up the mountain. The landslides have changed the stability of part of the rock face.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillSeb.08": "...okay?",
    "MV.Municipal.BillSeb.09": "He found where some rocks were knocked loose and rolled down to hit that Linus fella's tent. Found a smashed melon in the middle of it.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillSeb.10": "Wait, what? I didn't even notice anything fall- Is he okay?$2",
    "MV.Municipal.BillSeb.11": "Just hit his tent, luckily, and didn't do any real damage. But you gotta be careful up there. It just ain't stable as it used to be.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillSeb.12": "...I'll be careful. I should probably apologize, too...$2",
    "MV.Municipal.BillSeb.13": "That'd be a fine thing to do.$h#$b#Say, you ever thought of just throwin' it on one of those little islands in the lake? Or even in the lake?#$b#Melon's biodegradable. You could go out there, smash it, leave it for the birds. Doubt the fish'd mind either.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillSeb.14": "I guess that's not a bad idea.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillSeb.15": "And if you feel like throwin' rocks, you can always skip 'em. That's what I always do when I feel like throwin' things.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillSeb.16": "I don't know how.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillSeb.17": "I could show you.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillSeb.18": "...Alright.$7",
    //After Joja Lightning Strike Event
    "MV.Municipal.BillJojaClosed.01": "Oh!$11",
    "MV.Municipal.BillJojaClosed.02": "Howdy there. Just writing up one last ticket.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.BillJojaClosed.03": "I mean, look at this place.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillJojaClosed.04": "...How'd they wreck it so bad just movin' out? Didn't even secure the door.$8#$b#With as much money as they have, you'd think they could clean the place out proper.$8",
    "MV.Municipal.BillJojaClosed.05": "...Glad it's gone, though. Been most of my troubles since I've got here.#$b#'Specially glad it's gone before it shut anybody down. That's the kinda thing that creates food deserts.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillJojaClosed.06": "And now we can start cleaning up their mess for good.",
    //After Dwarf and Shadow fight event
    "MV.Municipal.BillKrobus.01": "The sheriff's checking the sewer. I saw what looked like someone sneaking down there early this morning.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillKrobus.02": "Well, uh... somethin for my apartment might be nice. I just moved in here recently.$11",
    "MV.Municipal.BillKrobus.03": "I've got some windchimes! I made them myself!$h",
    "MV.Municipal.BillKrobus.04": "Oh, those look real nice. Alright, I'll take one.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillKrobus.05": "Thank you! Feel free to visit again!$h",
    "MV.Municipal.BillKrobus.06": "Oh, uh... howdy there.$11",
    "MV.Municipal.BillKrobus.07.false": "Well, you don't seem surprised. So maybe you'll know what to do.#$b#'Cause I'm... not sure what to do here. He seems harmless, a nice little fella, but...$3#$b#Well, it ain't really my jurisdiction. Guess I should tell Ras?$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillKrobus.07.true": "Well, you don't seem surprised. So maybe you'll know what to do.#$b#'Cause I'm... not sure what to do here. He seems harmless, a nice little fella, but...$3#$b#Well, it ain't really my jurisdiction. Guess I should tell Ras and [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MarlonName]?$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillKrobus.08.false": "[LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasName] knows about him.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillKrobus.08.true": "[LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MarlonName] and [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasName] know about him.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillKrobus.09": "That's probably a good idea.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillKrobus.10.false": "Really?$11#$b#Well, that's a load off a' my mind. If [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHe]'s alright with him bein' here, I got no problems.$h#$b#I'll ask Ras about anyone else I should know about, too. Wouldn't want to cause any of 'em trouble.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillKrobus.10.true": "Really?$11#$b#Well, that's a load off a' my mind. If they're alright with him bein' here, I got no problems.$h#$b#I'll ask them about anyone else I should know about, too. Wouldn't want to cause any of 'em trouble.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillKrobus.11.false": "Right. If [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderHe]'s alright with him bein' here, I got no problems.#$b#I'll ask Ras about anyone else I should know about, while I'm at it. Wouldn't want to cause any of 'em trouble.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillKrobus.11.true": "Right. If they're alright with him bein' here, I got no problems.#$b#I'll ask them about anyone else I should know about, while I'm at it. Wouldn't want to cause any of 'em trouble.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillKrobus.12": "...Now what do I tell George?",
    "MV.Municipal.BillKrobus.13": "I didn't find anything down there't didn't belong. But I'll keep an eye out.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillKrobus.14": "I didn't find any trouble down there. But I'll keep an eye out.",
    //After Shane's 4 heart event
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.01": "Oh... hey. I'm... I'm waiting for the Sheriff. You seen him?$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.02": "He's definitely drunk.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.03": "Are you okay?",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.04": "I haven't seen him.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.05": "He goes to the Adventurer's Guild to visit [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:MarlonName] and Gil sometimes.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.06": "He might be at the [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasJob]'s place.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.07": "I'm fine! I just... need to see the sheriff.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.08": "Guess I'll keep waiting then.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.09": "So he might be a bit. That's alright, I'll wait.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.10": "The what? Oh, that weird old [LocalizedText Strings/MV.Municipal:RasGenderGuy] who lives in the tower?$0",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.11": "Howdy, there! What brings you two out here this late?$h",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.12": "...I'm doing a crime.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.13": "...'scuse me?$10",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.14": "Drunk in public. S'a crime, isn't it? So arrest me.$5",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.15": "Bill looks from you to Shane, slightly baffled.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.16": "I can walk you home if you need it, Shane...",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.17": "I'm sure the Sheriff won't mind making sure you get home safe.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.18": "Just arrest me already!$5",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.19": "...what's this really about, Shane? I ain't about to arrest anybody without knowing why.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.20": "It's... ugh.$5#$b#Jas. She was tired yesterday before school. She says... says it wakes her up when I get home late. I tried to get in early tonight but... I don't know. Time got away from me. Again.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.21": "...$2",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.22": "I mean, what, you want me to get caught sleeping on a bench or something? Saving you some time.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.23": "...Here.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.24": "...what's this key for?$2",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.25": "Spare key. It'll let you in the Municipal Building and into the jail.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.26": "Shane stares at the key in his hand.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.27": "We don't need to do any arrestin' for this. Keep it long as you need it.$3#$b#Just lock things up behind you, and lock things up when you leave in the mornin' if Alicia ain't in yet.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane1.28": "...$2#$b#...$3#$b#...Thanks.$0",
    //After Shane's first 7 heart event
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane2.01": "Hey, Sheriff. Here.$0",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane2.02": "Howdy there, Shane! What's this?$1",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane2.03": "Your spare key. I...$0#$b#I don't remember if I really thanked you when you gave it to me, but... It helped.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane2.04": "You're welcome! I'm always glad to help. Won't need it again?$1",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane2.05": "I don't think so. Therapy in Zuzu's been going really well.$6#$b#That guy Harvey recommended... He really gets it. Really gets how I feel. And he's really been helping me put myself together.$6#$b#And I'm working on some things with the chickens, something I actually like, to keep me busy in my free time. So I don't spiral.$6#$b#...Sorry, that was a lot, wasn't it.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane2.06": "Hey, it ain't easy sayin' how you feel if you're not used to it. I get it.#$b#And I don't mind listenin' at all! I'm damn glad to hear you're doin' better.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane2.07": "The eggs are hatching! Come quick!$1",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane2.08": "I'll be right there!$1#$b#Um... You wanna see too, Sheriff?$6",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane2.09": "I'd love to.$1",
    "MV.Municipal.BillShane2.10": "Farmer! The eggs are hatching! Come watch!$1",
    //After bus unlocks
    "MV.Municipal.BillPam.01": "You want to WHAT??$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillPam.02": "...Oh. You don't want any part of whatever argument's going on. But you do need to get into town...",
    "MV.Municipal.BillPam.03": "That deer ran into the road, the investigation proved it! There was a witness! And so what if I have a few after work? I never drink when I've gotta drive!$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillPam.04": "I read the reports-$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillPam.05": "And another thing! That drunk and disorderly was ages ago, when I was a dumb kid! Is the law just gonna hold that over me forever??$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillPam.06": "...$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillPam.07": "Why did this have to happen right outside the gate to your house?",
    "MV.Municipal.BillPam.08": "...$3#$b#...$4#$b#...I can't lose my job. Not again. The first time just about killed me.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.BillPam.09": "That's why I'm doin' this, I promise. Will you hear me out now?$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillPam.10": "...Sorry. I'm listening.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.BillPam.11": "Look, this is just future-proofin', alright? I ain't accusin' you of anything.$3#$b#Someone submitted an anonymous concern about your drinkin' and your job on the bus. Wasn't anything actionable. But obviously someone's concerned.$3#$b#If anything goes wrong, and I know accidents happen, there's a paper trail that'd blame your drinkin' even if that ain't what caused things.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillPam.12": "...$2",
    "MV.Municipal.BillPam.13": "So we're makin' a paper trail of our own.#$b#You blow clean before work an' after. If anyone makes a fuss about you, then we got evidence you're drivin' sober.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillPam.14": "...$2#$b#Alright. If it keeps my job safe, I'll do it.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillPam.15": "That's the spirit.$1",
    "MV.Municipal.BillPam.16": "Whew.",
    //HEART EVENT DIALOG
    //2 Heart Event
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.01": "Howdy, farmer! Need somethin?$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.02": "Just a social call? Well, come on in.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.03": "I hear you're new here. Come from the city, like me. What brought you into these parts?",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.04": "I needed to get away from the city.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.05": "I wasn't happy where I was.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.06": "I needed a change for my mental health.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.07": "I lost someone and needed a change of scenery.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.08": "Mm. I know how you feel. Came here for the same reason myself. City life never agreed with me.#$b#Home wasn't much better, mind you.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.09": "Oh, I never really fit in back home. Never even told anyone I was gay until I was gettin' serious with someone... just another thing for fellas to tease me over.$3#$b#Never agreed with my old man on how he did his job either. He was our sheriff.$3#$b#Suppose I thought I'd see how things were done better in the city, but maybe that was naive of me. To think things'd be better there.$3#$b#I really do hope I can make things better here. So I'm always happy to hear any of your ideas, as a citizen.#$b#Just put em in that suggestion box on the back wall, next to the mailroom. It's all anonymous, 'less you want your name on it.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.10": "...Sorry, that turned to business at the end, didn't it.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.11": "Oh! That's my daughter, Elena, when she was little. She won the spelling bee every year.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.12": "He's eager to pull out his wallet which is bursting with pictures.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.13": "Here she is now. She's a trauma surgeon. Graduated top of her class. Just finished her residency before I moved over.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.14": "And here's her birth parents. Guess you can tell she don't have my looks. Her mom Alma's always on the road, adventurin'. And here's my late husband Menawa.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.15": "Oh, I'm sorry.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.16": "...You're not really sure what to say about the 'late' bit he skimmed over.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.17": "Thank you kindly, but I'm alright now. It's been a while. He wouldn't want me to mourn forever.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.18": "I know what that look means. And I'm alright now. It's been a while since he passed. He wouldn't want me to mourn forever.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.19": "It was somethin' he was born with. He always knew that if the symptoms started rampin' up, he'd be on borrowed time.$3#$b#It gave us time to get ready. To fill up his bucket list and give him a good sendoff.#$b#Happened a few years ago, right after Elena graduated. That was the only thing on his list we were worried 'bout him missin'.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.20": "Sorry, am I interrupting something?",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.21": "Just a social call. Somethin' the matter?",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.22": "Oh good.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.23": "This should be quick. I've got a list of ideas for improving the town's police presence that I wanted to run by you.$h#$b#I've got them all written up, so you can go over them whenever you've got a moment.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.24": "Well, I'm always happy to hear suggestions. I'll give 'em a look.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.25": "I also notice you don't have a billy club or anything, so I've got one for you. It's even in your name, surprised you haven't got one.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.26": "...Well-$11",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.27": "No need to thank me, just doing my job. I'll give you time to look that over.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.28": "Actually, I'm glad you're here, farmer.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.29": "Would you mind showing me around your farm a bit? I'd like to hear how things are going up there. And if there's anything you need, of course!",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill2HeartEvent.30": "Another weapon for the safe, I guess.$8#$b#Well, let's see what he's got on this list...$3#$b#...Stricter ordinance ticketing? ...Breaks for Joja? Quotas... ugh.$5#$b#Guess I got my work cut out for me here.$3",
    //4 Heart Event
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.01": "Sheriff, what are you doing out here?$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.02": "...Well, the main complaint I've got from folks 'round here is trash bein' dumped on the beach. Can't investigate that without bein' on the beach, can I?$11",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.03": "This doesn't look much like investigating.$5",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.04": "Maybe it's a bad time for the beach...",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.05": "People don't act up with a cop starin' at 'em. They're more like to ignore a fisherman.$3#$b#'Sides, some of it could be washed in from the sea or out from the river. This is a good spot to see everything I need to see.$0",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.06": "...That does make sense. And where's your club?",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.07": "What does he need that for? A good rod and hook's fine for the fish.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.08": "Ah! Out here taking a break?$1",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.09": "It's a good day for it! Well, I should be heading on. There's paperwork I shouldn't procrastinate doing.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.10": "Ahoy there! You're welcome to join us.$1",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.11": "Bill, it seems like the mayor's got you rattled.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.12": "Not rattled exactly. Just... been tryin' to think of how to best put it all. Get my thoughts all organized.$3#$b#He had a list of things he wants outta me, and it may as well be a list of old mistakes.$8",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.13": "Well, take what he wanted today. How'd the police back home make you feel?$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.14": "A bit nervous.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.15": "Scared.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.16": "Angry.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.17": "Safe.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.18": "I don't know, they're just there.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.19": "That's fair. That's exactly what I mean.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.20": "That's fair. But a lot of people are afraid of 'em.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.21": "That ain't true for everyone, and for good reason. A lot of people are afraid of them. And no, I don't mean just criminals.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.22": "Back where I was born, my pa was the sheriff. I think Lewis'd like how he worked.$3#$b#He was real concerned with how things looked. He always looked busy. Even I felt his eyes on me, heavy as a ton of bricks, when I was out in town.$3#$b#It was... oppressive.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.23": "My grandpappy was like that. A hard man.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.24": "Mmhmm. I loved him, of course. He was my pa. But really, all he was doin' was scarin' everyone. And when people're scared, they start actin' like fools.$3#$b#Had this story goin' round about how foreigners were puttin' cheese on people's cars to kidnap 'em.$3.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.25": "What?",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.26": "That makes no sense.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.27": "I heard that one!",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.28": "You heard me. Cheese. Some nonsense about it gettin' you outta your car so you could be kidnapped.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.29": "Some nonsense about it gettin' you outta your car so you could be kidnapped. It ain't even the dumbest one I heard.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.30": "It made the rounds all over, I guess. Spread like a plague of fools.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.31": "It never happened. But people were scared over it. People hurt each other over it just outta misplaced fear.$3#$b#And who were they scared of? Who'd they hurt?$3#$b#Anybody from someplace else. Anybody who looked different. Heck, even people with disabilities, if wasn't one they could ignore.$8#$b#My pa didn't much care, though. As long as things looked good from the outside.$5",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.32.true": "Hmph. I had an awful woman tell me I was scaring her little one with my leg. Never mind how I felt!",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.32.false": "'Tis a shame. That doesn't help anybody.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.33": "Exactly. An' that ties into the substance abuse problem we had, too.$3#$b#Nothin' to do in a small place like that... we didn't even have the tourists you got here.  No beach, just swamp.$3#$b#Lotta those people who were strugglin' just needed help. Instead, they got made into villains. When people got scared, they got blamed for it.$8#$b#Pa always said it was their fault and came down on 'em hard. Like... like strugglin' and needin' help should be against the law. I couldn't stand it.$5",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.34": "That why you moved to the city? Ye never seemed the type for it.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.35": "Well, I also didn't wanna come out as gay at home. I didn't think I'd get hurt over it, just... The whole place seemed to push back on anyone different.$3#$b#I got flack for just not datin' in school like everyone else thought was normal. For not gettin' mad the right way, bein' too calm. Boys are 'supposed' to fight.$3#$b#But I also had this fool idea the city'd give me the perfect solution to my pa askin' me how I'd do it all better.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.36": "Well look at me bringin' things down. You're out here for a break and I'm just a wet blanket.#$b#My original point was, I don't want any of y'all to feel like that on my account.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.37": "I'll be sure to give ye a good slap if I start to feel that way.$1",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.38": "If the first one doesn't work, slap the other side, too.$1",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill4HeartEvent.39": "You know, I suppose it can't hurt to ask...#$b#Farmer, have you noticed any patterns in the litter on the beach? Awful lot of it's Joja surplus, so I got some ideas on where it's comin' from...",
    //6 Heart Event
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.01": "Give your mom my love. Love you, too. *click*",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.02": "Oh, howdy, farmer. Just talkin' to Elena. She calls just about every day.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.03": "Oh yeah, I've got a good relationship with her mom. She's like a sister.$h#$b#Her and Menawa, they parted on real good terms. Stayed best friends 'til the end.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.04": "That's good.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.05": "Why did they separate if they liked each other so much?",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.06": "Yeah, not everyone gets a separation that easy. Of course, it's the circumstances that helped. Mind if I wax nostalgic?",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.07": "If you're curious, I don't mind talkin' your ear off. Come join me.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.08": "Well, Menawa an' Alma, they grew up in an immigrant neighborhood. Real close-knit community. Their parents were best friends, and they saw their kids gettin' along. So...",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.09": "...You know, some people got good intentions, but they don't really think through the implications of things. Their parents made little jokes.$3#$b#How they were boyfriend and girlfriend when they weren't knee high to a grasshopper. They grew up hearin' that kind of thing all the time.$3#$b#So when he didn't feel any interest in other girls and she didn't feel interest in other boys... They just figured this was how things worked.#$b#This must be how romance was s'posed to go.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.10": "Their parents didn't want them to be gay?",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.11": "They didn't have a crush on anyone else?",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.12": "I've felt a bit like that before.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.13": "No, that's not it. It's more like... $3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.14": "How can I put it...$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.15": "Yeah. Social pressure, it can really mess with your head. I mean...$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.16": "Their parents weren't against them maybe bein' gay. But there's an amount of 'straight' in society that's all around us.$3#$b#And if you're a confused kid tryin' to figure yourself out, it may keep you from realizin' that you're another way. Their parents contributed to that on accident.#$b#And if you're into someone... someone like you and that ain't considered the 'normal' way things go, you might think of it wrong.#$b#You might think you admire them, wanna be like them. And only later, you realize maybe you wanted to be WITH them.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.17": "Did you feel like that too?",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.18": "Been there too.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.19": "I figured myself out sooner, but... yeah, a bit. I hate that it still happens. We should know better, right? That people don't have to be just one way.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.20": "That's too bad. I hate that it still happens. We should know better, right? That people don't have to be just one way.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.21": "So they got married. And they got pregnant straight away. They loved each other, really, but it was like family. They both felt like they were missin' somethin'.#$b#Anyway, I was considerin' goin' home with my tail between my legs around that time. City police had their own problems, and I wasn't exactly makin' friends in my department.$3#$b#And I just didn't much like livin' there.$3#$b#But then I saw this sad lookin', cute doctor out at lunch one day. Took a chance, sat down next to him, cheered him up a bit. He'd had a hard shift.$h#$b#Menawa always said he realized what he was supposed to be feelin' in love the first time he saw my smile.$4",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.22": "He figured himself out then. Realized he just wasn't interested in women that way. He tried to break it to Alma gently, but she cracked up in his face.#$b#She'd been adventurin' with these two gorgeous ladies. They had this casual open thing goin' on, worked great for them. And she realized she'd love to live like that.#$b#She was tryin' to figure out how to break it to him that she wasn't into men... or monogamy.$h#$b#So they split up, I got a husband and a daughter, and Alma got two cute girlfriends. She's still with 'em, too. Turns out she was a third piece they'd been missin'.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.23": "So you stayed for them?",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.24": "Doesn't seem like it solved your city problem.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.25": "I did.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.26": "Not really. But it made it worth stayin'.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.27": "Elena had friends I wouldn't want to take her away from. And Menawa couldn't stand small town life. Made him crazy.#$b#Last time he stayed someplace like that, he drank too hard and woke up in Gotoro with a new piercing only me and Yoba'll ever see.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.28": "Heh. Elena's why I moved out here, though.#$b#Things got a lot worse at my job round the time Elena finished her fellowship to become a trauma surgeon. Bad enough I couldn't really hide it from her.$3#$b#Since she was ready to live on her own, she made me promise to find a place I'd like, even if it took me away.#$b#She promised she'd call, we'd play games on the computer. We'd keep in touch. She just wanted me to be happy. She's a damn good kid.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.29": "Are you happy here?",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.30": "I'm glad you're happy here then.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.31": "She does seem like a good kid.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.32": "I am. I think I've found my place.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.33": "Me too. I think I've found my place.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.34": "You're a good kid, too, you know that?$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill6HeartEvent.35": "How's your family? If it ain't an uncomfortable topic, of course...",
    //8 Heart Event
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.01": "...$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.02": "...$8",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.03": "Looks like he's distracted by a letter with some news clippings.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.04": "What's the news?",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.05": "Bill? You okay?",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.06": "Uh, Elliott wanted me to drop off this book...",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.07": "Ah... @. Is that the book Elliott borrowed? Thanks for bringing it... just set it on the table.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.08": "Don't rightly know, @. Is that the book Elliott borrowed? Thanks for bringing it... just set it on the table.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.09": "Oh, thanks, @. Just set it on the table.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.10": "Using your actual proper name? This feels serious.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.11": "...Obituaries. My old man just passed on.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.12": "My ma went a couple months back, seems like. Alma found out. Sent me the news.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.13": "I'm sorry.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.14": "It must be hard finding out this way.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.15": "Months? Nobody told you sooner?",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.16": "I'm not that sorry.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.17": "No other way I could find out, really.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.18": "They wouldn't know how to contact me.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.19": "Look... I don't mind tellin' you all this, but be warned, it ain't pleasant. So you might want to have a seat.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.20": "...Once upon a time, I didn't think my parents were bad people really, just misguided and old-fashioned.$3#$b#I thought that if I just explained things right, if I found just the right angle to come from, they'd understand.$3#$b#The good people they truly were would come out.$8",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.21": "This is a mighty big check for an engagement present!$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.22": "Well, we know how it is starting a family.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.23": "And your man may be a doctor, but a cop's salary ain't nothin' to write home about.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.24": "I'm touched! This could really help with Elena's college. You know, she wants to be a doctor.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.25": "...$1",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.26": "...$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.27": "...Somethin' wrong?$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.28": "Well, we figured that... if you had the money, you could get a surrogate!",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.29": "...A surrogate?$10",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.30": "You said you wanted kids, right?",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.31": "And I got a daughter now.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.32": "Well, your fiancé has a daughter.$1",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.33": "...$2",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.34": "It's good of you to care, of course. But what about you? You need someone you can see yourself in, someone like us-",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.35": "What do you mean, 'like us?'$4",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.36": "Don't you take that tone with us!$1",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.37": "Why do you always have to be so difficult? You're gay, fine, you always just HAD to be different.$1",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.38": "But the least you could do is your duty as a son and give us a REAL grandkid.$1",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.39": "...$4#$b#So you've just been smilin' at me to my face and judgin' behind my back this whole time.$5",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.40": "Don't be silly, dear. Your father's just frustrated! Everyone wants grandkids like them-$1",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.41": "No, you always do this! You can't stand people thinkin' you're anything but a saint, so you talk rot in private.$4#$b#And Pa, you know you can't always just yell at anybody you don't agree with into submission.$4#$b#You know it looks bad. That's all either of you care about.$5",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.42": "I guess I'm a fool. A fool for thinkin' you had anything in you but hate. Keep your damn money.$4",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.43": "You listen here, you can't just walk away from family!$1",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.44": "You're no family of mine.$5",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.45": "You disrespectful little-$1",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.46": "Honey, no, I'll handle it. Bill! Bill, come back-$1",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.47": "...Ma rung my phone off the hook. Had to block her number.$8#$b#She'd have had to explain why she went from pickin' out a mother of the groom dress to not havin' a wedding to go to, you see.$3#$b#Don't know what all lies she told, but they made her look like a saint. They always did.$3#$b#Got a lot of calls from other family 'bout 'em. So I got a new number. They tried for years, though. Tried to shame me into comin' back to that viper's nest.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.48": "...They don't even mention either of 'em ever had a kid in their obituaries.$3#$b#Can't tell if it's the first time they respected my wishes or if it was one final dig.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.49": "I'm sorry. I'm not sure what to say.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.50": "I'm sorry. It sounds like you're better off without them.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.51": "I understand how you feel.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.52": "That's alright. Feelin's are just... complicated.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.53": "Oh, I know I am. Feelin's are just... complicated.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.54": "Mm. I kinda hate that you do. Means you've had a bad time of it at some point. But thanks.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.55": "Haven't told anyone 'bout them in... a long time. Haven't really felt safe talkin' bout it.$3#$b#Heh, half expected them to pop up every time I did like a boogeyman.$0#$b#...You're a good listener, you know that?",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill8HeartEvent.56": "...You know, I just got a new piece of coral for my tank. I think it fills the back out nice, and Steve loves it. Wanna see?",
    //10 Heart Event
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.01": "Howdy, everyone, and thank y'all for coming out.$h#$b#I've been collectin' feedback from everyone about what they want from their local law enforcement, and I hope that we can talk things over and come up with somethin' everybody's happy with.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.02": "Sounds fine to me.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.03": "Aye, alright.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.04": "...Okay.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.05": "First, off, we've had a lot of thoughts about fines and tickets.#$b#What I'm about to say ain't about ordinances like the ones for handicapped accessibility or keepin' businesses from poisonin' the environment.#$b#Those are there to help people in a real way. That's the kind of thing written in people's blood.$3#$b#But some folks's feedback on tickets reminded me of a concept we had back in the city. They called it 'broken window' policing.#$b#That is, the idea that minor things like broken windows encourage worse crimes. The appearance of disorder can encourage disorder.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.06": "Feel free to speak up, long as you ain't interruptin' anybody. Y'all ain't children, after all.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.07": "I read about that in a book that just came in at the library, An Inconvenient Cop.#$b#Since the term is vague, it allows officers to have a convenient excuse to discriminate against the poor and minorities.$2#$b#And some of those signs of 'disorder' are just signs of poverty and economic decline.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.08": "Good point, Leah. In fact, the fella that wrote that book is one of my personal heroes.$h#$b#Ticketing signs of disrepair just inflates the number of tickets going out, it doesn't really help the community.#$b#And it only punishes the poor. The rich can afford to pay a ticket. If the poor can't, that can end them up in jail or debt.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.09": "So we just do nothing?$2",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.10": "There are compelling studies that show that cleaning up the signs of disorder can actually reduce the rate of crimes.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.11": "So people just clean up their mess. That makes sense.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.12": "What if the people don't stick around? Those tourists are more than half the trouble.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.13": "If people ain't willin' or able to stick around long enough to clean up their mess, then that's a case for a ticket.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.14": "What about Joja's mess? And trash that's already there... and trash the ocean washes in?$2",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.15": "I'm afraid that needs fixin' on a level I can't reach. I got two hands to clean, and I got tickets.$3#$b#Maybe we could have community cleanup days? Once we get things clean, it'll be less work to keep it that way.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.16": "Oh, I like that! I can cook everyone who volunteers lunch and make sure they stay hydrated.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.17": "That's a fine idea, Gus.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.18": "What about budget? Profit from tickets could really help the city budget.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.19": "If I may... I also did some reading in preparation for this meeting, a work called Carceral Capitalism.#$b#A system that expects police to create profit can easily create a cycle of debt that hurts people even in their day to day life.$7",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.20": "And concern over profit means... well, what happens if there ain't enough crime?$3#$b#Officers ticket harder to get their numbers up. More innocent mistakes become a ticket instead of a warnin'.$3#$b#And if they're real low, maybe an officer just tickets someone they don't like the look of.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.21": "That almost sounds like making up crimes.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.22": "The law's vague enough and enough's left up to the officer's judgment that it ain't technically that.$3#$b#But it may as well be. There's people out there in debt because some cop needed to hit a quota.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.23": "That's... terrible.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.24": "It is! And again, the poor and minorities are the ones hit hardest. How can they fight it?$3#$b#In a system like that, the law becomes somethin' that can be bought by the rich. And the poor can't afford it.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.25": "Yeah, and we're already paying taxes. Ain't that what that money's are for?",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.26": "So we're all on the same page on that one?",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.27": "Yes, we are.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.28": "You got it!",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.29": "Sure thing!",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.30": "Alright then, folks. This next one is a bit of a rhetorical question, but I think...#$b#I think it'll answer a bunch of your concerns in one and get us toward some useful answers.#$b#What do y'all think justice is?",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.31": "It's about protecting the innocent by punishing criminals.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.32": "Is that really all there is to it, though? Punishment? Does that really fix everything?$2",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.33": "I think it can be real dangerous.#$b#A criminal system that focuses on punishment makes it real easy to take away a person's rights, even their humanity, just because they 'deserve' it.$3#$b#Think back to your broken windows. That's how cops can use things like that to discriminate against and hurt the community they're sworn to protect.$3#$b#If your law enforcement is just a man with a stick lookin' for a criminal to hit, it's no wonder there's communities out there who fear their own law enforcement.$3#$b#And I'd know, I've seen it myself back in the city. Even back where I was born.$8",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.34": "What would you say that justice is, then?",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.35": "I believe it's about cooperation, solving local problems... That way, we cut down on reasons people might have to do wrong.#$b#And when people do wrong, it's about makin' things right again, not just doin' more harm to dole out punishment.#$b#Some of y'all have been concerned about me not carryin' a weapon, and this is why.#$b#I don't want people doin' right out of fear. I want people to do right for a community that cares for 'em.#$b#And I think people WILL do their best to do right for a community that cares for 'em.$h#$b#So I want people to come to me because they know I'll do my level best to help.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.36": "So it's a bit like parenting.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.37": "I like that!",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.38": "That seems cool.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.39": "I'm not against this, but... Well, this isn't really what I expected from a police officer.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.40": "I uh... Sorry, this part's the hard part.$8#$b#It's mighty personal, see. I think it'll help y'all understand why I'm particularly set on this kind of policin'.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.41": "Add your support!",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.42": "Remain quiet.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.43": "Heh. Thanks, everyone.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.44": "There's a lot of... a lot of bad in the way we do police work.$3#$b#Just not playin' along, not takin' part in the bad made me an outsider to my own profession. Pushin' back against it made things worse.$3#$b#It came to a head when I offered to testify against an officer who put a teenager in the hospital for shopliftin'.$8",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.45": "That was you? I heard about that...",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.46": "I had to drag him off that kid. All over a candybar.$8#$b#I know I offered to do the right thing, but there was never a trial, just a civil suit. They settled it out of court.$3#$b#You know what that got me? Dead rats left in my locker. Told my boss, and he said 'You shouldn't a' been a rat, then.'$3#$b#Then I go to ticket a car for blockin' handicapped access and the driver stumbles out, armed, drunk, an' angry.$3#$b#I called for backup, just in case. Nobody answered.$8",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.47": "Geez...",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.48": "That's messed up.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.49": "Woah.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.50": "All these things we've talked about, they contributed to that system.$3#$b#I became my own department's enemy just by tryin' to protect the community instead of bludgeonin' it into submission.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.51": "They sent me here because nobody else wanted the job, but I think it's a real blessin'.#$b#I couldn't change the system. But I ain't in the system anymore, am I?$h#$b#I got a chance here to give people some real justice, with your help. To rights wrongs instead of causin' more of 'em.#$b#Maybe it won't be perfect, but at least we'll have tried for somethin' better. So how's that sound?",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.52": "Let's do it!",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.53": "Alright!",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.54": "Hear, hear!",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.55": "Alright then!$h#$b#Now I've got a list here of some ideas I've had. I'd love your input and your own ideas.#$b#First, there's somethin' called a Little Free Pantry. You take what you need, leave what you can, so nobody goes hungry.#$b#If people aren't strugglin', they're less likely to do wrong to keep their head above water.",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.56": "I can definitely build that!",
    "MV.Municipal.Bill10HeartEvent.57": "Ooh! We can work together! I can set it up with refrigeration!",
    //Rival Hearts Event
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.01": "Come, look at this.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.02": "I have stabilized the energies of this Mana Bloom. It will be greatly useful to me and help sustain me while I work.#$b#I would like to thank you for growing it.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.03": "...$2",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.04": "No, that is not everything I wished to say. I am... not adept at dealing with people. So I seek your advice.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.05": "Bill's choice of gift was... extremely thoughtful. He is perceptive and far more clever than he puts on.$7",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.06": "He noticed that I neglect my personal needs more than I should and sought to assist.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.07": "His visits are often the highlight of my week. I... do not wish to damage our relationship.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.08": "I am not certain how to tell him.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.09.1": "But I do not believe his work will leave him time to become an apprentice.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.09.2": "But I am not in need of any more apprentices.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.09.3": "But I do not believe his work will leave him time to become an apprentice. And it is unlikely the Ministry would approve either.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.10": "Are you sure that's what he wants?",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.11": "What else could all of this mean?",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.12": "Did he say he wanted to be your apprentice?",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.13": "No. But what else could all of this mean?",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.14": "Why do people usually give each other flowers?",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.15": "Because they...#$b#Oh.$4",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.16": "I think he really likes you.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.17": "I suspect Bill likes most...#$b#Oh.$4",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.18": "He said that you're cute when you talk about magic.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.19": "That's- The mystic arts are a serious matter.#$b#...He truly said that?$4",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.20": "But I destroyed my marriage. Bill knows this. I told him of my ex-wife when he asked about potential dangers in the valley.$2#$b#I told him... everything. You must be mistaken.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.21": "Bill is a forgiving person. He doesn't believe that one mistake makes someone irredeemable.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.22": "That is true. He said as much.$4",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.23": "What did Bill say when you told him?",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.24": "...That everyone makes mistakes. It is up to us to learn from them.$4",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.25": "...$7",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.26": "You clearly know you've made a mistake and have learned from it. What use is that without moving forward?",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.27": "...$2#$b#There is wisdom in your words. Nothing is gained by making a mistake and never trying again.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.28": "You shouldn't beat yourself up over your mistakes forever. You'll only stay stuck in the past.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRivalHeartsEvent.29": "You have given me much to think about. Thank you.",
    //Rival Hearts Date - Spring
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate1.01": "Is that the wizard laughing?",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate1.02": "Oh, I've not thought of it in ages, but I did something similar when I was quite young. I thought I had created a great work of art.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate1.03": "At least, I felt that way until I had to scrub the ink off the walls!$h",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate1.04": "So in another world, we coulda had Rasmodius the Artist?$h",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate1.05": "No, no, my talents lie elsewhere.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate1.06": "Well, everybody needs a hobby. As long as you enjoy it, you don't have to be any good at it.",
    //Rival Hearts Date - Summer
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate2.01": "The soil in these plants is awful dry, but the plants look nice anyway. Does he magic them healthy?",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate2.02": "Maybe he could use some farming tips.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate2.03": "Where is he, anyway?",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate2.04": "I never understood why my master felt that way... Nothing I said ever got through.$2",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate2.05": "Been there myself, unfortunately. It might not make sense, but...$8#$b#Well, you can't logic somebody out of a place they didn't logic themselves into.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate2.06": "Oh, this sounds serious. The plants can wait. Best to leave for now.",
    //Rival Hearts Date - Fall
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate3.01": "I don't think he's coming out...$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate3.02": "Lose somethin', Jas?",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate3.03": "Oh! Sheriff Bill!$1",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate3.04": "Can you help us?",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate3.05": "What's the trouble?",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate3.06": "It's a squirrel! I saw him moving funny. I think he's hurt, but he won't come out of the bush.$3#$b#The farmer's helping keep him from running off.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate3.07": "Well, he must be scared, what with all these people around. Poor fella.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate3.08": "I can ease the creature's fear. Perhaps it will emerge once it has calmed.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate3.09": "By all means, Ras, go for it.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate3.10": "It worked!$1",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate3.11": "Well, I see what you mean by him movin' funny. He's missin' a leg.$3",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate3.12": "Oh no!$2",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate3.13": "It looks like it's all healed up.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate3.14": "Maybe it was born like this.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate3.15": "Oh... Yeah, there's fur over it and everything.$3#$b#So he's just different!",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate3.16": "And that's alright.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate3.17": "Yeah!",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate3.18": "It is good that you care for nature's creatures.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate3.19": "Thank you so much for helping, Mr. Ras! You're not as scary as you look!$1",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate3.20": "...Do I truly look scary?$2",
    //Rival Hearts Date - Winter
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate4.01": "Snow's picking up again. Guess we should go inside.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate4.02": "Nonsense.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate4.03": "It's funny seeing an actual wizard act like a bird trying to impress a mate.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate4.04": "Sure it ain't any trouble? Won't disrupt your meditation?",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate4.05": "It's a simple shield. No trouble at all to hold for a wizard of my experience.",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate4.06": "Of course.$h",
    "MV.Municipal.BillRasDate4.07": "I actually learned it when I was quite young. It was a very snowy winter that year."
}